RADAR_LOAD("2026-01",[{"id":"10.1002/admt.202502272","t":"Amido‐Amine Co(II) Precursor‐Based Atomic/Molecular Layer Deposition Processes for Cobalt‐Organic Thin Films and Their Thermal Conversion to CoO Thin Films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/admt.202502272","s":"Advanced Materials Technologies","d":"2026-01-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Atomic/molecular layer deposition (ALD/MLD) offers a comprehensive process and application portfolio for metal–organic thin films; however, ALD/MLD process development for transition‐metal‐based materials remains very limited, despite the versatile functional properties of their compounds. In this work, to enrich the chemistry of transition metal precursors in ALD/MLD, an all‐nitrogen‐coordinated cobalt complex, Co(tmsaedma) 2 (tmsaedma = Bis(N,N‐dimethyl(N’‐trimethylsilyl)ethane‐1‐amino‐2‐amido), was employed as the metal precursor for the first time. The Co‐N coordination provides an optimal reactive site for a variety of organic linker groups, as demonstrated here by three organic precursors that share the same rigid benzene backbone but differ in reactive groups: 1,4‐benzenediol (hydroquinone; HQ), 1,4‐benzenedithiol (BDT), and 1,4‐benzenedicarboxylic acid (terephthalic acid","au":["Topias Jussila","Jorit Obenlüneschloß","Ji Liu","Olga Partanen","Sami Vasala","Detlef Rogalla"],"o":"回填","why":["ALD"],"zt":"含酰胺-胺配位的钴(II)前驱体原子/分子层沉积工艺及其热转化为钴氧化物薄膜","zb":"研究对象为钴-有机薄膜，采用原子/分子层沉积(ALD/MLD)工艺制备，使用含氮配位的钴配合物Co(tmsaedma)2作为前驱体，并与三种有机配体(HQ、BDT、BDC)反应。通过多种表征技术和DFT计算研究薄膜的稳定性和分解机制，发现BDC>HQ>BDT的活性和稳定性趋势。在N2气氛中热处理Co-BDC薄膜可制备低密度、多孔的CoO薄膜。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c23865","t":"Dynamic Proton Extraction from Supramolecular Functionalized Metal–Organic Framework/Ti 3 C 2 MXene Hybrids for Efficient Solar Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c23865","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-01-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In N2 photoreduction, photogenerated holes and electrons are involved in H2O photolysis for proton supply and the weakening of the N≡N triple bond for N2 activation, respectively. Rationally regulating the structure-activity relationship of these catalytic sites for available generation of charge carriers is crucial for optimizing N2-to-NH3 conversion efficiency. Herein, a robust photothermal catalyst carboxyl-enriched supramolecular (perylene tetracarboxylic acid, PTA) functionalized MIL-125(Ti)/MXene having dynamic proton extraction sites is designed for efficient N2 photoreduction. Among these, MIL-125(Ti), PTA, and Ti3C2 MXene are, respectively, responsible for N2 activation, reliable proton supply through interconversion between Brønsted acid and its conjugated base, and a photothermal response for accelerated reaction kinetics. The synergistic collaboration of these functionally di","au":["Ying Tang","Juan Jia","Hui Zeng","Zebao Rui"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于高效太阳能氨合成的超分子功能化金属有机框架/Ti3C2 MXene杂化物的动态质子提取","zb":"设计了一种羧基富集的超分子（酞菁四羧酸，PTA）功能化 MIL-125(Ti)/MXene 光热催化剂，利用 MIL-125(Ti) 激活 N2，PTA 提供质子，MXene 提供光热响应。在 100-500 mW cm-2 照射下实现了 314.5-654.7 μmol g-1 h-1 的高太阳能-氨转换率。"},{"id":"10.26678/abcm.cobem2025.cob2025-1239","t":"Development of a Reduced-Scale Plant for Green Ammonia Production in Belo Horizonte: Integration of the COSMOS MB.H2 Electrolyzer and Synthesis Reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.26678/abcm.cobem2025.cob2025-1239","s":"Proceedings of the 28th International Congress of Mechanical Engineering","d":"2026-01-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ana Paula Castro Filaretti","Bruno Dayvid Lima","Leonardo Mitre","Pedro Paiva Brito","Cristiana Brasil Maia"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"贝洛奥里藏特绿色氨生产缩小规模工厂的开发：COSMOS MB.H2 电解槽与合成反应器的集成","bt":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6145203","t":"Enhanced Room-temperature Gas Sensing Performance of Carbon-doped In2S3 via a Facile Flash Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6145203","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-01-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yinfen Cheng","Nianzhong Ma","Zhong Li","Lieqi Liu","Zhentao Ji","Yi Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过简便闪蒸焦耳加热增强碳掺杂 In2S3 的室温气体传感性能","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6145977","t":"STUDY OF ATOMIC LAYER DEPOSITED METAL OXIDES AS ADHESION LAYER FOR PLATINUM ONTO THERMAL SILICON DIOXIDE","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6145977","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-01-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Gabriel MOAGĂR-POLADIAN","Florin NĂSTASE","Gabriel Craciun","Cătălin Parvulescu","Victor MOAGĂR-POLADIAN","Octavian Gabriel SIMIONESCU"],"o":"回填","why":["ATOMIC LAYER DEPOSIT"],"zt":"原子层沉积金属氧化物作为铂在热二氧化硅上的粘附层的研究","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5dt02610e","t":"Ruthenium( ii ) carbonyl amidates – a new class of precursors for atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5dt02610e","s":"Dalton Transactions","d":"2026-01-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ru( ii ) carbonyl amidates are introduced as a new precursor class for ALD. Substitution pattern engineering yielded volatile and liquid complexes, which are predicted to interact favorably with O 2 , O radicals, and NH 3 .","au":["Jorit Obenlüneschloß","Cara-Lena Nies","Michael Gock","Michael Unkrig-Bau","Jan-Niklas Huster","Michael Nolan"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"钌(II)羰基酰胺——原子层沉积的新型前驱体","zb":"研究Ru(II)羰基酰胺作为原子层沉积(ALD)前驱体的可行性。通过取代模式工程合成挥发性和液体配合物，并预测其与O2、O自由基和NH3的相互作用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c06027","t":"Unveiling the Mechanism in Joule Flash Heating Polyethylene Pyrolysis: Insights from ReaxFF MD Simulations and Experiments","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c06027","s":"Energy & Fuels","d":"2026-01-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In this research, the impacts of the Joule flash heating (JFH) method on the generation of monomers and three-phase products during polyethylene (PE) pyrolysis were investigated by using reactive molecular dynamics (ReaxFF MD) simulations. Temperature ranges for JFH were determined through thermal pyrolysis. Meanwhile, JFH experiments at 70, 80, and 90 V were carried out by using the JFH reactor. The trends of the calculated results are consistent with those of the experimental results. Increasing the maximum ( T max ) or minimum ( T min ) temperatures in JFH promoted secondary reactions. Then, compared to the pyrolysis characteristics of PE under the JFH and the conventional continuous heating (CCH) conditions, the results showed that the yields of char decreased in the JFH method, and the tar produced by pyrolysis exhibited a higher H/C ratio. The yield monomer (C 2 H 4 ) obtained by t","au":["Yao Zhang","Dikun Hong","Tong Xu","Mingfan Zhang","Mengyang Sun","Chunbo Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Flash Heating"],"zt":"揭示焦耳闪热聚乙烯热解的机理：来自ReaxFF MD模拟和实验的见解","zb":"通过ReaxFF分子动力学模拟和实验研究了闪蒸焦耳热对聚乙烯裂解中单体和三相产物生成的影响。结果显示闪蒸焦耳热下的乙烯产率比连续加热高近12倍，且冷却阶段抑制了乙烯的氢解离和与烷基自由基的反应。","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mset.2026.01.002","t":"Production of sustainable graphene and its derivatives through flash joule heating: A systemic review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mset.2026.01.002","s":"Materials Science for Energy Technologies","d":"2026-01-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The goal of this critique is to examine the newer Flash Joule Heating (FJH) technique for the production of graphene and hydrogen to determine if either production method is sustainable. By conducting an in-depth evaluation into the FJH technique as well as other methods such as chemical vapor deposition, this review seeks to determine which is the most effective method. With high-voltage pulses, FJH can quickly transform waste materials rich in carbon, such as biomass and plastics, into superior quality graphene, while also producing hydrogen gas as a by-product. FJH has been estimated to use around 7.2 kJ/g of energy which is considerably lower than other methods, and it also has a higher scalability and a 90% lower carbon footprint than the classical methods and does not need as many costly catalysts and undergoes less energy demanding processes like electrolysis, which makes it more ","au":["Nebechi Kate Obiora","Chika Oliver Ujah","Benjamin Nnamdi Ekwueme","Christian O. Asadu","Peter Apata Olubambi"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪焦耳加热制备可持续石墨烯及其衍生物：系统综述","zb":"评估了利用高电压脉冲将生物质和塑料等富碳废料转化为高质量石墨烯并副产氢气的闪蒸焦耳热技术。该技术能耗约7.2 kJ/g，碳足迹比传统方法低90%，具有高可扩展性和经济可行性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/open.202500480","t":"RuKY Catalyst‐Packed Permeation Membrane for Quantitative Ammonia and d3‐Ammonia Dehydrogenation to Ultrapure Hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/open.202500480","s":"ChemistryOpen","d":"2026-01-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia is a promising carbon‐free hydrogen carrier, but incomplete ammonia dehydrogenation (cracking) generates atmospheric emissions of NO x , a potent greenhouse gas. Additionally, incomplete cracking of ammonia leads to regulatory challenges in nuclear and fusion power, where tritiated ammonia (NT 3 ) emissions are strictly controlled. Therefore, we report the use of low‐temperature ammonia dehydrogenation catalysts (3%Ru/1%Y/12%K/Al 2 O 3 ) in a palladium alloy H 2 permeation membrane for quantitative conversion of ammonia into hydrogen and nitrogen at industry‐relevant conditions. This catalytic membrane reactor system achieved an astonishing effluent concentration of <1 ppm at 450°C under a 100% NH 3 stream, which is far beyond the 99.6% conversion target required for the adoption of ammonia as a vehicle fuel. The low‐temperature ammonia dehydrogenation catalyst was tested in a pa","au":["Christopher J. Koch","Jennifer Naglic","John T. Kelly","Logan Kearney","José D. Arregui‐Mena","Jochen Lauterbach"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"用于定量氨和 d3-氨脱氢制备超纯氢的 RuKY 催化剂填充渗透膜","zb":"在钯合金 H2 渗透膜中使用了低温氨脱氢催化剂（3%Ru/1%Y/12%K/Al2O3），在 450°C 和 100% NH3 流下实现了出口浓度 <1 ppm 的惊人结果。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202511297","t":"Engineering Metastability in Atomic Layer Deposition: Polymorph and Valence Control","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202511297","s":"Small","d":"2026-01-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Metastable phases characterized by their higher‐energy states offer promising functionalities for electronic, catalytic, and energy applications. However, their synthesis is often hindered by high formation energy barriers and thermodynamic constraints. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) has attracted significant interest for a wide range of applications, including semiconductors, advanced electronics, and energy‐related applications, owing to its exceptional features, including low‐temperature processing, precise atomic‐scale control, and excellent conformality. Despite these advantages, the inherently low thermal budget of ALD poses significant challenges for the synthesis of metastable phases. This review presents a comprehensive overview of the recent advances in the engineering of metastability via ALD. This review categorizes the manifestations of metastability in ALD into two ","au":["Jihoon Jeon","Seung Ho Ryu","Seungwan Ye","Gwang Min Park","Seong Keun Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积中元稳态的工程化：多晶型物和价态控制","zb":"综述原子层沉积(ALD)工程化元稳态的进展，分为多晶型转变和价态控制两个方向。多晶型物通过温度调制、衬底诱导晶格匹配、晶粒尺寸细化、掺杂和固溶体形成等策略实现选择性相稳定；价态控制通过温度调制、前驱体/反应物设计和后沉积处理实现。通过反应机理与材料相的关联，提供元稳态相稳定化的见解和实用设计原则。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.3390/separations13020043","t":"Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia on Conductive Metal-Organic Frameworks with Varied Metal Centers","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/separations13020043","s":"Separations","d":"2026-01-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate pollution in groundwater poses severe threats to ecosystems and human health, making the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) a promising remediation technology. Conductive metal–organic frameworks (cMOFs) with π-d conjugation, dispersed active sites, and tunable structures are ideal candidates for electrocatalysis. Herein, we synthesized a series of cMOFs (M3(HHTP)2, M = Fe, Zn, Cu, Co, Ni) via conjugated coordination between hexahydroxytriphenylene (HHTP) ligands and metal ions and systematically investigated their NO3RR performance. Electrochemical tests revealed that Fe3(HHTP)2 exhibits superior catalytic performance for nitrate reduction, achieving a high NH3 selectivity of 99.5% and a yield rate of 676.4 mg·gcat−1·h−1 at −1.0 V vs. RHE (reversible hydrogen electrode), along with excellent cyclic and structural stability. In situ attenuated total reflection Fou","au":["Yanpeng Chen","Ran Mao","Rohit Kumar","Jianbo Shi","Li Yan"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"具有不同金属中心的导电金属有机框架上电催化硝酸还原制氨","zb":"合成了系列 cMOFs (M3(HHTP)2, M = Fe, Zn, Cu, Co, Ni)，其中 Fe3(HHTP)2 表现出最佳性能，在 -1.0 V vs. RHE 下实现了 99.5% 的 NH3 选择性和 676.4 mg·gcat−1·h-1 的产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aic.70247","t":"Enhanced ammonia decomposition for hydrogen production over an inverse MgO /Co catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.70247","s":"AIChE Journal","d":"2026-01-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The development of efficient non‐noble metal catalysts for ammonia decomposition is critical for advancing hydrogen energy technologies. This study presents a breakthrough in catalyst design by constructing an inverse MgO/Co architecture to synergistically enhance both activity and stability. Through systematic comparison with conventional Co/MgO and unsupported Co nanoparticles, the inverse MgO/Co catalyst achieves 98.7% NH 3 conversion at 600°C, with a hydrogen production rate 4.6‐fold higher than Co/MgO at 550°C, alongside exceptional stability at 600°C (>90% retention after 100 h). Advanced characterizations (XRD, TEM, XPS, and TPD) reveal that MgO encapsulation of Co nanoparticles generates abundant interfacial oxygen vacancies and strong metal‐support interactions, which lower the apparent activation energy to 80.2 kJ mol −1 (vs. 172.3 kJ mol −1 for Co/MgO). These interfac","au":["Shigang Li","Yongsheng Li","Bin Dai","Yong Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"用于产氢的逆 MgO /Co 催化剂增强氨分解","zb":"通过构建逆 MgO/Co 架构，该研究制备了高效非贵金属催化剂。与传统 Co/MgO 相比，该催化剂在 600°C 下实现 98.7% NH3 转化率，氢气产率比 Co/MgO 高 4.6 倍，且在 600°C 下稳定运行 100 小时后仍保持 >90% 活性。XRD、TEM、XPS 和 TPD 表征显示，MgO 包覆 Co 纳米颗粒产生丰富的界面氧空位和强金属-载体相互作用，显著降低了表观活化能至 80.2 kJ mol−1。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-68539-5","t":"Nonequilibrium pulsed heating freezes sintering of supported metal nanocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-68539-5","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-01-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract Supported metal nanoparticles always experience thermal-induced sintering that severely depresses their catalytic performance and durability. Recently, ultrafast heating technology has been widely adopted in synthesizing diverse metal nanoparticles or even single atoms on supporting materials, offering enhanced anti-sintering capabilities compared to conventional heating protocols. However, the mechanisms and kinetics underlying this anti-sintering behavior during ultrafast heating processes remain poorly understood. Here, using in situ scanning transmission electron microscopy and theoretical analysis, we microscopically reveal a metastable state for supported metal nanoparticles induced by ultrafast heating pulses, which significantly mitigates the thermal-induced sintering while effectively improves the crystallization degree of metal nanoparticles together with the metal/sup","au":["Jiawei Huang","Zhouyang Zhang","Guangren Wang","Jiaqi Chen","Yucheng Zhang","Jian Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["pulsed heating"],"zt":"非平衡脉冲加热冻结负载金属纳米催化剂烧结","zb":"负载金属纳米颗粒在加热过程中易发生烧结，严重影响催化性能和耐久性。该研究采用原位扫描透射电子显微镜和理论分析，揭示超快加热脉冲下负载金属纳米颗粒的亚稳态，有效缓解了热诱导烧结，同时提高了金属纳米颗粒和金属/载体界面的结晶度。研究发现，石墨烯片负载的 Pt 纳米颗粒在超快加热脉冲下热力学不稳定但动力学稳定，Pt/石墨烯界面逐渐优化，导致 Pt 纳米颗粒具有优异的烧结抗性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ee06529a","t":"Unveiling the mechanism of lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction via operando X-ray scattering in a flow cell with hydrogen oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ee06529a","s":"Energy & Environmental Science","d":"2026-01-22","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Operando GI WAXS in a flow cell with HOR revealed LiNH 2 as the only stable crystalline intermediate in the lithium mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) and the unique solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formed by diglyme electrolytes.","au":["Niklas H. Deissler","J. Bjarke V. Mygind","Valerie A. Niemann","Jakob B. Pedersen","Valentin Vinci","Shaofeng Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202523036","t":"Integrating Cooperative Dual Active Sites Onto a Plasmonic Photocatalyst for Synergistic Promotion of the Reduction and Oxidation Half‐Reactions in Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202523036","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2026-01-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Photocatalytic N 2 fixation offers a promising sustainable alternative to the energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch process. Since N 2 fixation involves the reduction and oxidation half‐reactions, understanding their synergistic relationship and achieving their cooperation is crucial for improving the overall efficiency of N 2 fixation. To fulfill this objective, we have designed a type of Ru‐WO 3− x /CoO x photocatalyst with respective reduction and oxidation active sites. In this type of photocatalyst, Ru doping not only provides reduction sites to facilitate N 2 adsorption and activation but also optimizes the band structure by widening the defect band and elevating the Fermi level. Meanwhile, the CoO x clusters serve as O 2 evolution sites that can accelerate hole utilization and improve electron–hole separation, thereby enhancing N 2 reduction. Consequently, the Ru‐WO 3− x /CoO x ph","au":["Boyuan Wu","Leilei Zhang","Ke An","Penglei Wang","Yini Fang","Baocheng Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"将协同双活性位点整合到等离激元光催化剂上以协同促进氨合成中的还原和氧化半反应","zb":"为解决氨合成中还原和氧化半反应的协同问题，该研究设计了具有还原和氧化活性位点的 Ru-WO3−x/CoOx 光催化剂。Ru 掺杂提供还原位点并优化能带结构，CoOx 集团作为析氧位点加速空穴利用。在纯水中，该催化剂 NH3 产率达到 131.95 µmol g−1 h−1，在 AM 1.5G 光照下太阳能-化学转化效率为 0.22%，且在整个测试范围内（包括近红外）表观量子效率均高于 0.2%。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1051/metal/2025116","t":"Effect of carbonaceous material graphitization degree on carburization behavior in Fe-C mixture powder during rapid heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1051/metal/2025116","s":"Metallurgical Research & Technology","d":"2026-01-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The transition to carbon-neutral steelmaking necessitates the development of alternative carburizing agents to replace fossil-derived carbon. This study investigates the effect of graphitization degree and ash content of biochar on the carburization behavior of Fe–C mixture powders during rapid heating. Carbonaceous materials with varying crystallinity and composition were prepared through heat treatment and acid leaching, and their structural disorder was evaluated using Raman spectroscopy (I V /I G ratio). Carburization behavior was examined using a laser microscope equipped with infrared image heating under controlled Ar–H 2 atmosphere. Two experimental approaches were applied: compact Fe–C pellets to determine complete melting temperature, and iron plate–carbon contact samples to observe the initial melt formation. Results showed that ash content, rather than graphitization degree, w","au":["Ayana Ono","Tatsuya Kon","Ko-ichiro Ohno"],"o":"回填","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"碳质材料石墨化程度对快速加热时 Fe-C 混合粉末渗碳行为的影响","zb":"该研究调查了生物炭的石墨化程度和灰分含量对快速加热时 Fe-C 混合粉末渗碳行为的影响。通过热处理和酸浸制备了不同结晶度和组成的碳质材料，并使用拉曼光谱（I V /I G 比率）评估其结构无序度。在控制 Ar-H 2 气氛下，使用配备红外图像加热的激光显微镜考察了渗碳行为。结果表明，灰分含量而非石墨化程度是影响渗碳的主要因素。富灰样品表现出延迟和局部熔化，而去灰生物炭显示出更早和更均匀的熔化。I V /I G 比率与熔化行为相关性有限。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c11754","t":"In Situ Surface-Selective Oxidation-Induced Construction of a Mo 2 C@MoO 2+ x Heterostructure for Enhanced Electrosynthesis of Ammonia via Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c11754","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-01-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ) is a cornerstone of modern agriculture, energy storage, and clean fuel, yet its production via the conventional Haber–Bosch process consumes vast amounts of energy and emits severe greenhouse gas. Electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) offers a carbon-neutral alternative but faces challenges in N 2 activation and competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Herein, the Mo 2 C@MoO 2+ x heterostructure is designed via a novel in situ surface selective oxidation transformation strategy, leveraging synergistic MXene–oxide interactions to enhance NRR efficiency. The heterostructure achieves an exceptional NH 3 yield of 13.6 μg h –1 mg –1 with 40% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at −0.35 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) and maintains stability for 72 h. Density functional theory (DFT) reveals widened conduction/valence bands and elevated Fermi levels at t","au":["Qi Wang","Hangning Liu","Yifei Deng","Xiaopeng Zou","Shihai Yan","Jie Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"用于增强电合成氨的氮还原的 Mo2C@MoO2+x 异质结构的原位表面选择性氧化诱导构建","zb":"利用 MXene-氧化物协同相互作用，该研究通过原位表面选择性氧化转化策略设计了 Mo2C@MoO2+x 异质结构。该结构在 −0.35 V vs RHE 下实现 13.6 µg h−1 mg−1 的 NH3 产率和 40% 的法拉第效率，并保持 72 小时稳定。DFT 计算显示，MXene-MoO2+x 界面拓宽了导带/价带并提升了费米能级，MoO2+x 优化了电子密度以抑制析氢反应并促进 N2 活化。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c10521","t":"Reconstructed Cu 2 O@CuCo Heterostructure with Accelerated Hydrogenation Kinetics for Air Plasma-Derived Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c10521","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-01-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ) is a key chemical for sustainable energy and nitrogen utilization, and air plasma-derived electrochemical NH 3 synthesis offers a promising alternative to traditional methods, yet significant challenges remain. Here, we develop an R-Cu 2 O@CuCo catalyst with abundant heterogeneous interfaces and strong electronic interactions via a facile chemical synthesis and electroreduction reconstruction strategy, exhibiting excellent NO 2 – -to-NH 3 performance. Benefiting from the efficient activation of active hydrogen intermediates by R-Cu 2 O@CuCo, NH 3 Faradaic efficiencies (FE) exceeding 90% are achieved over a wide voltage range (0 V vs RHE to −0.5 V vs RHE), with maximum FE and NH 3 yield reaching 95.4% at −0.1 V vs RHE and 1.22 mmol h –1 cm –2 at −0.6 V vs RHE, outperforming most reported catalysts. More importantly, a complete NH 3 synthesis system is realized by integrati","au":["Gaoming Jin","Pengzuo Chen","Yun Tong"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"具有加速氢化动力学的重构 Cu2O@CuCo 异质结构用于空气等离子体衍生氨合成","zb":"通过化学合成和电还原重构策略，该研究开发了具有丰富异质界面和强电子相互作用的 R-Cu2O@CuCo 催化剂。得益于对活性氢中间体的高效活化，该催化剂在 −0.1 V vs RHE 下实现 95.4% 的最高法拉第效率和 1.22 mmol h−1 cm−2 的氨产率。通过将火花放电等离子体与膜电极组件电解槽集成，该系统实现了从空气到 NH4Cl 的连续合成，Zn-NO2− 电池最大功率密度达 6.35 mW cm−2。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202512253","t":"Emerging Atomically Engineered RuNi‐Zn‐ZIF‐8 Catalyst for Remarkably High Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia and Electrocatalytic Oxygen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202512253","s":"Small","d":"2026-01-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Here, we report an atomic substitution strategy between RuNi‐Alloy and ZIF‐8 to synthesize Ni single‐atom catalyst (SAC) supported on a carbon‐nitrogen framework (CNF), derived via high temperature calcination (900°C) of RuNi‐ZIF‐8. The resulting atomically engineered (RuZn)/Ni‐CN exhibits multifunctional activity for both Nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) and Oxygen evolution reaction (OER). In NO 3 RR, (RuZn)/Ni‐CN delivers a high ammonia yield of 10199 µg h −1 mg −1 cat with 84% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at −0.9 V vs. RHE. This performance is obtained using a Pt anode in a 0.1 M NaNO 3 solution containing 0.1 m Na 2 SO 4 , following the optimization of pH. (RuZn)/Ni‐CN achieves superior OER performance, with an overpotential of 303 mV at 50 mA cm −2 and exhibits low charge transfer resistance (0.43 Ω) and a small Tafel slope (62 mV/dec), indicating fast reaction kinetics. T","au":["Aparna Jamma","Sourav Bhowmick","Uttam Kumar Ghorai","Ragunath Madhu","Subrata Kundu","Moses AbrahamB"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"用于显著高电催化硝酸盐还原为氨和电催化析氧反应的新兴原子工程化 RuNi-Zn-ZIF-8 催化剂","zb":"通过 RuNi 合金与 ZIF-8 的原子取代策略，该研究合成了负载于碳氮框架上的 Ni 单原子催化剂。该原子工程化 (RuZn)/Ni-CN 在硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3 RR) 中表现出高氨产率 10199 µg h−1 mg−1 cat 和 84% 法拉第效率，在 0.1 M NaNO3 溶液中于 −0.9 V vs RHE 下实现。同时，该催化剂在析氧反应中表现出 303 mV 的过电位和 62 mV/dec 的塔菲尔斜率，TOF 达 0.3278 × 10−3 s−1，并保持 30 小时稳定。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202513655","t":"Effect of Atomic Layer Deposition of Ultra‐Thin Oxide on Reactivity and Durability of Perovskite Oxygen Electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202513655","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-01-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"ABSTRACT Conductive perovskite oxides (ABO 3 ) are key oxygen electrode materials for energy conversion applications, but they suffer from irreversible performance degradation at elevated temperatures due to surface chemical instability. In this study, we investigate how the surface chemical environment and oxygen exchange kinetics of thin‐film La 0.6 Sr 0.4 CoO 3 are affected by the atomic layer deposition of binary oxides—specifically HfO 2 and Al 2 O 3 . We observe that both HfO 2 and Al 2 O 3 overcoats successfully maintain the rapid oxygen exchange rate on the electrode surface. Interestingly, however, their effects on the electrode surface chemistry differ significantly, as do the ideal coating thicknesses, as revealed by X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy, secondary ion mass spectrometry, and transmission electron microscopy analyses. These findings suggest two distinct mechanisms f","au":["Jongsu Seo","SungHyun Jeon","Hyunseung Kim","San Kwak","DongHwan Oh","Bonjae Koo"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积超薄氧化物对钙钛矿氧电极反应性和耐久性的影响","zb":"该研究调查了原子层沉积的二元氧化物（HfO 2 和 Al 2 O 3 ）对 La 0.6 Sr 0.4 CoO 3 薄膜表面化学环境和氧交换动力学的影响。研究发现，HfO 2 和 Al 2 O 3 过盖层成功地保持了电极表面的快速氧交换速率。然而，它们对电极表面化学的影响及其理想涂层厚度存在显著差异，X 射线光电子能谱、二次离子质谱和透射电子显微镜分析揭示了这一点。这些发现表明，氧化物过盖层通过两种机制稳定钙钛矿表面：（1）减少吸引 Sr 离子到表面的氧空位，（2）作为清除剂消耗表面多余的 Sr，并提出了基于原子层沉积的新型策略来提高钙钛矿表面耐久性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.6097346","t":"Defect-Controlled Covalent Anchoring of Graphene for Hydrogen-Interference-Free and Joule-Heating-Stable Ammonia Detection","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6097346","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-01-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ken Uchida","Yuxiang Shen","Jun Terao","Tomohiro Iwai","Ryo Toyoshima"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"缺陷控制的石墨烯共价锚定用于无氢干扰和焦耳加热稳定的氨检测","ob":"涉及碳材料","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta09029f","t":"Solvent effect on the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction: a deep potential molecular dynamics simulation with enhanced sampling for the case of the ruthenium single atom catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta09029f","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-01-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Deep potential molecular dynamics simulations with enhanced sampling were employed to investigate the solvent effect on the electrocatalytic NRR and obtained the energy barrier of the rate-determining step consistent with experiments.","au":["Bowen Zhang","Pengchao Zhang","Xuefei Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"溶剂效应对电催化氮还原反应的影响：针对钌单原子催化剂的深势分子动力学增强采样模拟","zb":"利用深势分子动力学增强采样模拟研究了溶剂效应对电催化氮还原反应的影响，并获得了与实验一致的反应能垒。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202523422","t":"Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction Reaction to Ammonia at Industrial‐Level Current Densities","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202523422","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2026-01-18","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 − RR) represents a promising green synthesis technology, enabling both resource utilization of nitrate (NO 3 − ) pollutants in wastewater and provision of a sustainable ammonia (NH 3 ) source for carbon neutrality. The key challenge in advancing NO 3 − RR toward practical application lies in developing catalytic systems that maintain excellent activity, high selectivity, and long‐term stability at industrial‐level current densities (>300 mA cm −2 ). Although NO 3 − RR has been developed to a certain extent, there has yet to be a comprehensive summary and analysis of the advancements in this field at industrial‐level current densities up to now. This review begins with an introduction to the mechanism and theoretical basis of NO 3 − RR, systematically summarizes and analyzes catalyst design strategies for industrial‐level curre","au":["Zhijie Cui","Honghai Wang","Chunli Li","Wenchao Peng","Jiapeng Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"工业级电流密度下电化学硝酸根还原制氨","zb":"综述了工业级电流密度（>300 mA cm−2）下电化学硝酸根还原反应（NO3− RR）的进展，总结了合金化、原位衍生、异质结构建等催化剂设计策略，并讨论了电解槽技术、技术经济分析和生命周期评估。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.22441/sinergi.2026.1.021","t":"Towards low-carbon ammonia: simulation and economic evaluation of blue ammonia with carbon utilization","u":"https://doi.org/10.22441/sinergi.2026.1.021","s":"SINERGI","d":"2026-01-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The proposed blue ammonia production considers technical, environmental, and economic aspects. The design of the blue ammonia using CCUS (Carbon Capture, Utilization, and Storage) technology in this study contributes to reducing carbon emissions and providing a more environmentally friendly ammonia supply in East Java, Indonesia, due to the availability of raw materials and geological storage locations for CO2 storage. Technically, the blue ammonia production was simulated with Aspen Hysys V.14.0. uses the Kellogg process, where the ammonia converter operates at a temperature of 437.60 °C and a pressure of 141.9 bar. From the environmental aspect, as much as 68.34 tons/h of ammonia produced produces CO2 71.36 tons/h, which is a total emission of 1.06 tons CO2/ tons NH3. In this study, CO2 delivery with a pipe length of 85 km (ID:539.8mm; OD: 558.7mm) was simulated using default parameter","au":["Vibianti Dwi Pratiwi","Sukmawati Kunup","Nada Rahma Aulia","Helmi Sayid Hasan","Jono Suhartono"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"迈向低碳氨：碳利用蓝氨的模拟与经济评价","zb":"利用Aspen Hysys V.14.0模拟了采用CCUS技术的蓝氨生产工艺，在437.60 °C和141.9 bar条件下运行，实现了每吨氨1.06吨CO2的减排，并计算得出总年度成本为$82.25x106/year，氨平准化成本为$93.28x108/吨NH3。"},{"id":"10.3390/ma19020348","t":"Ultrafast High-Temperature Synthesis of Battery-Grade Graphite Through Energy-Effective Joule Heating: A Combined Experimental and Simulation Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma19020348","s":"Materials","d":"2026-01-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This work introduces ultrafast high-temperature graphitization (UHG) as an effective method to synthesize graphite with significantly reduced processing times of about 100 s and reduced consumed energy, as opposed to conventional methods that require several days at 2800 K. This novel process achieves graphitization of up to 90% within a few minutes due to the accelerated kinetics occurring at temperatures as high as 3400 K. Samples processed using UHG attained stable cyclic capacities of 350 mAh/g, which is fully comparable to commercially available graphite. Finite Element Simulations were also used to calculate the energy consumption for a scaled-up configuration, and it was found that the UHG approach reaches ultra-low energy consumption, requiring only 2.4 MJ/kg for the direct conversion of coke into graphite. By minimizing the duration of high-temperature processing and employing l","au":["Jie-Cong Liu","Qi Li","Salvatore Grasso","Baptiste Py","Zi-Long Wang","Francesco Ciucci"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳加热实现电池级石墨的超快高温合成：实验与模拟研究结合","zb":"该研究引入超快高温石墨化（UHG）作为合成石墨的有效方法，将处理时间缩短至约 100 秒，并显著降低能耗，而传统方法需要在 2800 K 下处理数天。UHG 过程在高达 3400 K 的温度下实现了加速动力学，几分钟内即可达到 90% 的石墨化率。UHG 处理的样品获得了 350 mAh/g 的稳定循环容量，与市售石墨相当。有限元模拟计算了规模化配置的能量消耗，发现 UHG 方法达到超低能耗，直接将焦炭转化为石墨仅需 2.4 MJ/kg。通过缩短高温处理时间和采用局部加热，UHG 有望缓解传统艾奇逊炉面临的一些挑战。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.46754/ps.2026.01.005","t":"ENGINEERING NITROGENASE FOR PLANETARY SUSTAINABILITY: RENEWABLE-POWERED BIOHYBRID AMMONIA AND THE ROAD BEYOND HABER–BOSCH","u":"https://doi.org/10.46754/ps.2026.01.005","s":"Planetary Sustainability","d":"2026-01-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The Haber–Bosch process made synthetic ammonia abundant and helped feed a growing population, but it also created a sustainability debt: Substantial fossil-energy demand, significant CO2 emissions, and pervasive nitrogen losses that drive eutrophication and N2O emissions. Biological nitrogen fixation (BNF) is attractive because nitrogenase reduces N2 to NH3 at ambient conditions, yet the enzyme’s oxygen lability, complex metallocluster biosynthesis, and high energy demand complicate implementation beyond its native microbial contexts. This review synthesises three routes to reduce fertiliser dependence: Engineered nitrogen-fixing biofertilisers that excrete ammonium; plant-centred strategies that extend symbiosis or express nitrogenase components in organelles; and, purified nitrogenase or biohybrid systems powered by renewable electricity or light. We emphasise biohybrid devices because","au":["Mohammad Pooya Naghshbandi"],"o":"回填","why":["HABER-BOSCH"],"zt":"工程化氮酶以实现行星可持续性：可再生能源驱动的生物混合氨及超越哈伯-博施之路","zb":"综述了减少化肥依赖的三条途径，包括工程化固氮生物肥料、植物中心策略以及利用可再生能源或光驱动的纯化氮酶或生物混合系统，强调了蛋白质工程在稳定性、界面耐受性和电子传递方面的关键作用。","ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202513337","t":"Lignin Crosslinked Ultrastable ANF‐CNT Films for Photo‐Thermal‐Electric Conversion and Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202513337","s":"Small","d":"2026-01-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Aramid nanofibers (ANF) with excellent toughness and stability are promising candidates as flexible matrix for fabrication of wearable devices, nevertheless, which still suffer from the drawback of surface activation. In this work, the lignin that possesses structural affinity with ANF is applied to activate ANF, which further composites with carbon nanotubes (CNT) through vacuum filtration and subsequent thermal‐crosslinking processes. Ascribing to the multiply interfacial lignin binding (i.e., noncovalent hydrogen bonding and π–π stacking, and covalent C─C and C─O─C bonds), the resulted films (AL x C y (TC)) exhibit simultaneously enhanced mechanical properties (the tensile strength of ∼88.6 MPa and toughness of ∼77.2 MJ m −3 ), stabilities (e.g., in commonly used solvents, and under −20°C–100°C and deformation) and conductivity (∼148.2 S m −1 ). The synergy of CNT and lignin ","au":["Zhihao Duan","Zhiwei Xu","Wenbin Zhang","Hongzhen Cai","Xiangsheng Han"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"木质素交联超稳定 ANF-CNT 薄膜用于光热电转换和焦耳加热","zb":"该研究将具有 ANF 结构亲和性的木质素应用于激活 ANF，并通过真空过滤和后续热交联工艺与碳纳米管（CNT）复合。由于多重界面木质素结合（即非共价氢键和 π–π 堆积，以及共价 C─C 和 C─O─C 键），所得薄膜（AL x C y (TC)）表现出同时增强的机械性能（抗拉强度约为 88.6 MPa，韧性约为 77.2 MJ m −3）、稳定性（例如，在常用溶剂中，以及 -20°C–100°C 和变形下）和导电性（约为 148.2 S m −1）。CNT 和木质素的协同作用赋予复合薄膜优异的光热电转换能力（在 1000 W m −2 照射下 10 秒内产生 62°C 和 150 mV）。此外，超稳定的 AL x C y (TC) 还表现出良好的焦耳加热性能（在 25 V 下产生 105°C），可用于取暖和融化冰雪。这项工作为优化 ANF 与功能组分的界面相容性提供了一种绿色高效的方法，"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202524256","t":"Cathodic Interfacial Oxidation‐Induced Rapid Synthesis of Nickel Phosphate Electrocatalyst from Wastewater for Acidic Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202524256","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-01-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 − RR) presents a promising strategy for simultaneous wastewater remediation and ammonia synthesis. However, the fabrication of efficient, stable, and economically viable electrocatalysts remains a significant challenge. Addressing this, we report the rapid (14 min) electrodeposition of an amorphous nickel phosphate catalyst directly onto a metallic foam cathode, utilizing nickel plating wastewater as a precursor under high‐current conditions. This catalyst exhibits exceptional performance in acidic media, achieving a Faradaic efficiency of 96.6% for ammonia at −0.5 V (versus RHE) in 10 mM NO 3 − solution, alongside remarkable electrochemical stability exceeding 20 h. We attribute the catalyst formation to the oxidation of hypophosphite at the cathode interface during high current polarization and its subsequent co‐deposition w","au":["Maonan Ran","Xuechuan Li","Guan Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"阴极界面氧化诱导的从废水中快速合成镍磷电催化剂用于酸性硝酸根转氨","zb":"在高电流条件下利用镀镍废水作为前驱体，在金属泡沫阴极上快速（14 min）电沉积制备了非晶镍磷催化剂，在10 mM NO3−溶液中−0.5 V下氨的法拉第效率达96.6%，且在200 mA cm−2下稳定运行30 h。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202501268","t":"Electrocatalytic Reduction of NO on the MnN 4 Single‐Atom Catalyst Interfacing With Metal Supports: A First‐Principles Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202501268","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-01-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrocatalytic nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) presents a promising route for sustainable ammonia production. Transition metal (TM) single atoms coordinated with four pyridinic nitrogen atoms in a carbon matrix (denoted as TMN 4 –C) have emerged as a vital class of single‐atom catalysts (SACs). Recent studies shown that interfacing TMN 4 –C with TM surfaces can significantly boost catalytic performance in several reactions. However, whether such interfacial strategies can similarly enhance NORR activity remains unclear. Herein, we present a comprehensive theoretical investigation of the NORR on the MnN 4 –C SACs supported on various metal substrates. Constant‐potential first‐principles calculations reveal that metal supports, particularly Ag(111), markedly improve NORR performance, reducing the limiting potential from –0.69 V (free‐standing MnN 4 –G) to –0.39 V. Mec","au":["Suhang Li","Jiahang Li","Chong Yan","Qinzhuang Liu","Feijiu Wang","Dongwei Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"金属支撑界面上MnN4单原子催化剂电催化还原NO：第一性原理研究","zb":"通过恒电位第一性原理计算研究了金属支撑界面对MnN4-C单原子催化剂电催化还原NO反应的影响，发现Ag(111)支撑将极限电位从–0.69 V提升至–0.39 V，并确定了*NO → *NHO为决速步，揭示了自旋磁矩和dz2带中心是控制活性的关键因素。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s41981-025-00371-2","t":"A three-dimensional model of a packed bed reactor with resolved pore space - an example of ammonia synthesis and its improvements","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s41981-025-00371-2","s":"Journal of Flow Chemistry","d":"2026-01-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Michael Abeiku Daniels","Agnieszka Truszkowska"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"解析孔隙空间的固定床反应器三维模型：氨合成及其改进示例","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c05532","t":"Identifying the Catalytic Descriptor of Single-Atom Catalysts in Nitrate Reduction Reaction: An Interpretable Machine-Learning Method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c05532","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-01-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Elucidating the catalytic descriptor that accurately characterizes the structure-activity relationships of typical catalysts for various important heterogeneous catalytic reactions is pivotal for designing high-efficient catalytic systems. Here, an interpretable machine learning technique was employed to identify the key determinants governing the nitrate reduction reaction ($\\rm NO_3RR$) performance across 286 single-atom catalysts (SACs) with the active sites anchored on double-vacancy $\\rm BC_3$ monolayers. Through Shapley Additive Explanations (SHAP) analysis with reliable predictive accuracy, we quantitatively demonstrated that, favorable $\\rm NO_3RR$ activity stems from a delicate balance among three critical factors: low $\\rm N_V$, moderate $\\rm D_N$, and specific doping patterns. Building upon these insights, we established a descriptor ($\\psi$) that integrates the intrinsic cata","au":["Zhen Zhu","Shan Gao","Jing Zhang","Xuxin Kang","Shunfang Li","Xiangmei Duan"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"识别双空位 BC3 单层锚定单原子催化剂在硝酸盐还原反应中的催化描述符：一种可解释机器学习方法","zb":"利用可解释机器学习技术分析了286种锚定在双空位BC3单层上的单原子催化剂的硝酸盐还原反应性能。通过SHAP分析发现，低N_V、中等D_N和特定掺杂模式是关键因素。据此建立的描述符ψ整合了内在催化性质和中间体O-N-H角θ，成功捕捉了结构-活性关系，并预测了16种低成本非贵金属催化剂，其中Ti-V-1N1的极限电位最低，仅为-0.10 V。","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acselectrochem.5c00405","t":"Dynamic Quantification of Nitrogen Species in Acidic Titanium-Catalyzed Nitrate Reduction toward Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acselectrochem.5c00405","s":"ACS Electrochemistry","d":"2026-01-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of NO 3 – to NH 3 offers a sustainable pathway for nitrogen recycling and can have significant implications for future chemical production. Key challenges in this domain include identifying the transient nature of reactive intermediates and the quantitative measurement of reaction products. These areas are critical for mechanistic insights that can inform future technological development. Here, we report an analysis of NO 3 – reduction on a metallic Ti surface, enabled by experimental methodologies with exceptional sensitivity and time resolution for the identification and quantification of NO 3 – reduction species. Combining gas chromatography, ion chromatography, and electrochemical mass spectrometry, we identified and quantified key reduction products (NH 4 +, H 2, NO 3 –, NO 2 –, N 2 O), including difficult-to-detect species NO. Ti electrodes achieved hi","au":["Wrayzene L. Willoughby","Ryan T. Hannagan","Jinyu Guo","Peter Benedek","Kyra M. K. Yap","Michaela Burke Stevens"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"酸性钛催化硝酸盐还原生成氨过程中氮物种的动态定量","zb":"利用气相色谱、离子色谱和电化学质谱，在金属钛表面实现了对硝酸盐还原过程中关键产物(NH4+、H2、NO3-、NO2-、N2O)的识别和定量，包括难检测的NO物种。在-1.0 V vs RHE下，Ti电极的NH4+法拉第效率平均为82.3%，并首次定量检测到NO和N2O。NO的出现支持其作为反应中间体的作用，N2O的形成指向不产生NH3的替代氮路径，且H2产量的增加与NO和N2O产量的减少相关，可能与Ti氢化物形成有关。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.5c04187","t":"Room Temperature Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrate by Multiphase Heterogeneous Iron-Based Nanocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.5c04187","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-01-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"We present a facile methodology for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis using a multiphase iron nanocatalyst (r-IOD (Fe@Fe 3 O 4 @Fe 2 O 3 )) under ambient conditions. Structural and physicochemical analyses of r-IOD were conducted using pXRD, Mössbauer spectroscopy, HRTEM, and XPS analyses, where r-IOD features a three-phase composite architecture, enabling room-temperature reduction of nitrate (NO 3 – ) to NH 3 . The NH 3 formation was confirmed by 15 N isotope labeling and 1 H NMR analysis and quantified by UV-Vis spectroscopic analysis. Postreaction UV-DRS and XRD of r-IOD were also analyzed, indicating Fe-redox participation in the process of NO 3 – reduction.","au":["Twinkle","Jaidev Kaushik","Pinky Singh","Deepika Saini","Sher Singh Meena","Shyam Kumar Choudhary"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"多相铁基纳米催化剂室温合成氨","zb":"提出了一种利用多相铁纳米催化剂(r-IOD (Fe@Fe3O4@Fe2O3))在室温下合成氨的简便方法。通过pXRD、穆斯堡尔谱、HRTEM和XPS分析，证实r-IOD具有三相复合结构，能够实现室温下硝酸盐(NO3-)到氨(NH3)的还原。利用15N同位素标记和1H NMR分析确认了NH3的形成，并通过UV-Vis光谱定量测定，同时分析了反应后的UV-DRS和XRD，表明Fe的氧化还原参与了NO3-还原过程。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1021/acsmaterialslett.5c01305","t":"MoS 2 -Modified Electrodes for the Lithium Redox Mediated Nitrogen Reduction at Low Overpotentials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsmaterialslett.5c01305","s":"ACS Materials Letters","d":"2026-01-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"High rates of the lithium redox-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) typically require significant overpotentials >0.5 V, limiting energy efficiency of the process. Aiming to accelerate the Li-NRR at low overpotentials, we used nickel cathodes modified with a layer-expanded molybdenum disulfide (MoS 2 LE ). Under 15 bar of N 2 and an apparent Li-NRR overpotential of 0.2 V, the MoS 2 LE /Ni electrodes produce NH 3 at an improved yield rate of 90 ± 20 nmol s –1 cm –2 and faradaic efficiency of 57% ± 2%, as compared to 39 ± 4 nmol s –1 cm –2 and 39 ± 5% for unmodified Ni (in 2 M lithium bis(trifluoromethylsulfonyl)imide + 0.1 M C 2 H 5 OH tetrahydrofuran solutions). Characterization of the electrodes suggests that the improved performance stems from the transformation of MoS 2 LE into (poly)sulfide species within the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). These results broaden our und","au":["Jason John","Rebecca Y. Hodgetts","Thi Mung Vu","Darcy Simondson","Syed Asad Abbas","Hoang-Long Du"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"MoS2改性电极用于低过电位的锂氧化还原介导的氮还原","zb":"使用层扩张的二硫化钼(MoS2 LE)修饰镍电极，旨在实现低过电位下的锂介导氮还原反应(Li-NRR)。在15 bar N2和0.2 V过电位下，MoS2 LE/Ni电极的氨产率为90 ± 20 nmol s-1 cm-2，法拉第效率为57% ± 2%，优于未修饰的镍电极(39 ± 4 nmol s-1 cm-2, 39 ± 5%)。表征表明，MoS2 LE在固体电解质界面(SEI)中转化为(聚)硫化物物种，这改善了性能，加深了对Li-NRR性能与SEI关系的理解。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03719","t":"Ammonia-Promoted Lithium Redox-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03719","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2026-01-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Protonation of the lithium nitride intermediate is a critical step of the lithium redox-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR), which is commonly provided by the ethanol proton carrier. While the field explores alternative, more stable H + shuttles, the capability of NH 3 to deliver protons for the conversion of Li 3 N into NH 3 and Li + has been majorly overlooked. Herein, we demonstrate a high ammonia yield rate of 350 ± 40 nmol s –1 cm –2 and faradaic efficiency of 93 ± 6% under 15 bar nitrogen in 6 h Li-NRR experiments when 0.08 M NH 3 is added to ethanol-free tetrahydrofuran solutions of 2 M lithium bis(trifluoromethylsulfonyl)imide electrolyte. Extended two-day-long experiments demonstrated the stability of the NH 3 -promoted Li-NRR, with only slightly decreased performance. In contrast, the introduction of NH 4 + suppresses the Li-NRR under these conditions. These results s","au":["Koustav Banerjee","Duong T. H. Truong","Darcy Simondson","Ngoc Trung Nguyen","Cuong K. Nguyen","Cameron L. Bentley"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"氨促进锂氧化还原介导的氮还原","zb":"研究发现氨能够提供质子将锂氮化物(Li3N)转化为NH3和Li+，从而促进锂介导的氮还原反应(Li-NRR)。在15 bar氮气下，向不含乙醇的四氢呋喃电解液中添加0.08 M NH3，实现了350 ± 40 nmol s-1 cm-2的氨产率和93 ± 6%的法拉第效率。两天的实验表明该体系具有稳定性，而NH4+的引入则抑制了Li-NRR。这表明反应产物本身可能充当质子穿梭体，实现了技术简化。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cjoc.70448","t":"Binuclear Cobalt Complex‐Catalyzed Dehydrogenation of Ammonia Borane and Transfer Hydrogenation of Alkenes, Carbonyls and Nitriles: High Efficiency under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cjoc.70448","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemistry","d":"2026-01-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Comprehensive Summary The development of efficient and sustainable catalytic systems based on earth‐abundant metals for hydrogen storage and green organic synthesis represents a significant and urgent challenge. While ammonia borane (AB) is a promising hydrogen carrier, its catalytic dehydrogenation and subsequent transfer hydrogenation have predominantly relied on precious‐metal catalysts, and existing cobalt‐based systems often lack the combination of ultrahigh activity and broad utility. Addressing this gap, this work introduces a well‐defined macrocyclic bispyridyldiimine‐supported binuclear cobalt complex that serves as a highly efficient catalyst for both AB dehydrogenation, achieving high H₂ release and a wide range of AB‐mediated transfer hydrogenation reactions under mild conditions. The system demonstrates exceptional performance by facilitating the reduction of diverse substra","au":["Yingxue Liao","Shuang Liu","Jiayi Lin","Ke Chen","Jun Tang","Lianghua Zou"],"o":"回填","zt":"双核钴配合物催化氨硼烷脱氢及烯烃、羰基和腈类转移氢化：温和条件下的高效催化","zb":"介绍了一种大环双吡啶二亚胺支撑的双核钴配合物，作为氨硼烷脱氢及多种底物转移氢化的高效催化剂。该体系在温和条件下实现了烯烃、吲哚、腈类和羰基化合物的高产率还原，在0.01 mol%的催化剂负载下表现出超高活性，且能在室温下氢化吲哚等挑战性底物。研究发现双核结构的协同效应是高活性的关键，对应的单核钴配合物在相同条件下无活性。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1134/s1995080225611920","t":"Effect of Joule Heating on the Result of Pulsed Heating of the Diverter Material of a Thermonuclear Reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1134/s1995080225611920","s":"Lobachevskii Journal of Mathematics","d":"2026-01-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The paper presents a mathematical model of material heating taking into account Joule heating, the Thomson effect and the Peltier effect on the sample surface, which are determined by calculating the total current. A model of current distribution in a tungsten sample and an evaporated substance when the surface is heated by an electron beam is considered. The model is based on solving the equations of electrodynamics and the two-phase Stefan problem in a cylindrical coordinate system. The two-phase Stefan problem determines the temperature in the sample area with the contribution of Joule heating and the Thomson effect, which are obtained from calculating the total current at each time step. The power density of the laser pulse and metal evaporation from the surface are set on the sample surface and the Peltier effect is taken into account. The model parameters are taken from experiments","au":["G. G. Lazareva","V. A. Popov"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳热对聚变堆偏转材料脉冲加热结果的影响","zb":"建立了考虑焦耳加热、汤姆逊效应和珀耳帖效应的钨样品加热数学模型，并求解了圆柱坐标系下的两相斯蒂芬问题。该模型基于电子束应用材料测试实验数据，分析了电子束加热下钨样品和蒸发物质的电流分布及温度场。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5gc04579g","t":"CoFe-double hydroxide honeycomb covered CuCo 2 O 4 nanosheets as a core–shell nanostructure catalyst for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate conversion to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5gc04579g","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2026-01-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"CuCo 2 O 4 spinel oxide nanosheets grown on carbon cloth are covered by a dense layer of CoFe-LDH honeycomb. The prepared heterojunction showed high catalytic activity and efficiency to electrochemically convert nitrate pollutants to useful NH 3 .","au":["Zijuan Zhao","Xiujuan Zhang","Yinghao Li","Shuxian Qin","Xiaoqiang Liu"],"o":"回填","zb":"在碳布上生长的 CuCo 2 O 4 纳米片被一层致密的 CoFe-LDH 蜂窝状结构覆盖。制备的异质结表现出高效电化学将硝酸盐污染物转化为有用 NH 3 的催化活性和效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1093/nsr/nwag008","t":"Piezocatalytic ammonia synthesis from seawater nitrate for sustainable nitrogen cycle","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nsr/nwag008","s":"National Science Review","d":"2026-01-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Zhiguo Niu, Yang Fu, Tianyi Ma; Piezocatalytic ammonia synthesis from seawater nitrate for sustainable nitrogen cycle, National Science Review, , nwag008,","au":["Zhiguo Niu","Yang Fu","Tianyi Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"Niu, Fu, Ma 研究了从海水中硝酸盐进行压电催化合成氨以实现可持续氮循环。","top":1},{"id":"10.1007/s10854-026-16592-7","t":"Low- cost solution combustion synthesis of highly sensitive ammonia sensing device based on Zn doped SnO2 nanostructures","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10854-026-16592-7","s":"Journal of Materials Science: Materials in Electronics","d":"2026-01-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Nishu Rani","Sunil Kumar","Sridhar Babu","Ravi Kant Choubey","Umesh Kumar Dwivedi","Vijay Kumar"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1149/2162-8777/ae315e","t":"Area-Selective Atomic Layer Deposition of Ruthenium on SiO 2 /W Patterns Using Silicon-Based Inhibitors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/2162-8777/ae315e","s":"ECS Journal of Solid State Science and Technology","d":"2026-01-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Area-selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD) has garnered considerable interest over the past decade due to its potential to enable bottom-up fabrication of nanostructures with atomic-scale precision, eliminating the need for complex multiple patterning and lithographic processes that often introduce alignment challenges. Selective deposition is achieved by facilitating nucleation and growth on the targeted growth area (GA) while chemically passivating the non-growth area (NGA) to inhibit film formation. This study explores the inhibition performance of two small molecular inhibitors (SMIs) dimethylamino-trimethylsilane (DMATMS) and bis(dimethylamino)dimethylsilane (BDMADMS) were evaluated, for area-selective ALD (AS-ALD) of Ru on the surface consisted with SiO 2 and W using a carbonyl-based Ru precursor and O 2 as an oxidant at 250 °C. BDMADMS, applied via spin-coating and baking, en","au":["Gagi Tauhidur Rahman","Shogo Okugawa","Ryo Yokogawa","Yoshiteru Amemiya","Daichi Tanaka","Akinobu Teramoto"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"基于硅基抑制剂在SiO2/W图案上选择性原子层沉积Ru","zb":"选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）因其在纳米结构原子级精度制造中的潜力而备受关注。本研究探索了两种小分子抑制剂（SMIs）二甲基氨基三甲基硅烷（DMATMS）和双（二甲基氨基）二甲基硅烷（BDMADMS）在250°C、使用羰基Ru前驱体和O2作为氧化剂的AS-ALD中抑制性能。BDMADMS通过旋涂和烘烤，使Ru选择性地沉积在W表面，有效抑制了SiO2表面的成核和沉积，持续达500个ALD循环。DMATMS浸涂提供了短期抑制，但Ru最终沉积在SiO2上。BDMADMS在SiO2上形成稳定的抑制剂层，表现出强化学稳定性，有效保护表面免受氧化环境，防止Ru沉积，而DMATMS形成的抑制剂层在氧化条件下不稳定，导致表面钝化丧失和后续Ru沉积。最终，使用BDMADMS作为SMI，在三维SiO2和W图案表面实现了优化的AS-ALD Ru，Ru仅选择性地沉积在W区域，展示了对成核和沉积的精确控制，其在先","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta08766j","t":"Ultrafast Joule heating: synthesis–structure–property relationships and sustainable application","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta08766j","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-01-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ultrafast Joule heating (UJH) has emerged as a cutting-edge technology for synthesizing advanced functional materials (AFMs), representing a burgeoning field of research with significant scientific and industrial implications.","au":["Fengbo Yu","Jiewen Luo","Jiaqi Zhu","Xiaoguan Duan","Jing Wang","Jian Ji"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"超快焦耳热：合成-结构-性能关系及可持续应用","zb":"超快焦耳热（UJH）作为一种前沿技术，用于合成先进功能材料（AFMs），代表了一个新兴研究领域，具有显著的科学和工业意义。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta08241b","t":"In situ ammonia synthesis and energy generation via aqueous Zn–NO 3 − batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta08241b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-01-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Zn–NO 3 − battery is a “one stone-three birds” strategy enabling energy generation, NH 3 synthesis & nitrate remediation. FeCu(1 : 2)S x catalyst enhances selectivity via Cu adsorption & Fe hydrogenation, powering 62 LEDs for 70 h.","au":["Akansha Chaturvedi","Shivangi Mehta","Tharamani C. Nagaiah"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"FeCu(1 : 2)S x 催化剂通过 Cu 吸附和 Fe 氢化提高选择性，驱动 Zn–NO 3 − 电池在合成氨的同时产生能量，并成功点亮 62 个 LED 灯 70 小时。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c11509","t":"Enabling Resource Utilization of N 2 O: Selective Electrocatalytic Reduction to Nitrogen and Ammonia via Competing Pathways over Ni-MoS 2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.5c11509","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-01-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Nitrous oxide (N 2 O) electrocatalytic reduction (eN 2 ORR) represents a promising strategy for mitigating greenhouse gas emissions, yet its potential for simultaneous resource recovery remains largely unexplored. Herein, we report a nickel-modified molybdenum disulfide catalyst (Ni-MoS 2 ) that steers the eN 2 ORR through a competing reaction network, enabling the coproduction of N 2 and NH 3 . Comprehensive characterization (XRD, Raman, HAADF-STEM, XPS, UV–vis, SECM) confirms the highly dispersed Ni species effectively modulate the electronic structure and surface properties of MoS 2 . This dual-pathway mechanism transforms the process into an integrated purification and resource recovery system, enabling a total Faradaic efficiency of 72.8% at −0.3 V (vs RHE) through the concurrent production of N 2 (79% selectivity) and NH 3 (21% selectivity). By combining in situ infrared spectrosco","au":["Luyu Wang","Lei Pan","Haoming Li","Yunlong Li","Huanjie Zhang","Ruinian Xu"],"o":"回填","zb":"Ni-MoS 2 催化剂通过竞争性反应网络引导 N 2 O 电催化还原，实现 N 2 和 NH 3 的共生产。在 -0.3 V (vs RHE) 下，总法拉第效率达到 72.8%，其中 N 2 选择性为 79%，NH 3 选择性为 21%。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aic.70215","t":"Flash joule‐heating technology for material manufacturing, processing, and emerging applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.70215","s":"AIChE Journal","d":"2026-01-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Flash Joule‐heating (FJH) technology emerges as a transformative advancement in electrothermal processing with minimal carbon footprint, which leverages high‐intensity electrical pulses to rapidly heat conductive materials to extreme temperatures (often exceeding 3000 K), inducing dramatic structural transformations through non‐equilibrium pathways, thus displaying feasibility across various application scenarios. Noteworthily, FJH technology has evolved from a laboratory practice to a cornerstone of sustainable materials engineering, witnessing ever‐growing researching interests. Thus, a holistic and timely summary of the recent progress and development of FJH technology is of crucial importance to deepen the understandings and update the remaining difficulties in each application that need to be resolved. While challenges still remain on inhibiting the scaled production upon t","au":["Xiaoxi Yuan","Chaohui Yan","Shaochen Zhang","Yuqi Yang","Shengtai Zhou","Peng Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule-heat"],"zb":"闪蒸焦耳热技术利用高强度电脉冲将导电材料快速加热至极端温度（通常超过 3000 K），通过非平衡路径诱导剧烈的结构转变，在材料制造、加工和新兴应用中展现出可行性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.17586/2220-8054-2025-16-6-749-754","t":"Mathematical modeling of industrial ammonia synthesis using nonlinear reactiondiffusion equations","u":"https://doi.org/10.17586/2220-8054-2025-16-6-749-754","s":"Nanosystems: Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics","d":"2026-01-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This study proposes a mathematical model for ammonia synthesis based on nonlinear reactiondiffusion equations. The model integrates degenerate gas diffusion in the reactor with Haber-Bosch reaction kinetics to explore efficiency and environmental sustainability. A theoretical analysis is conducted to establish the existence and stability of global solutions for the underlying degenerate parabolic system. Numerical simulations were validated against industrial data from Navoiyazot facility in Uzbekistan, demonstrating 98.2% accuracy in concentration profiles and outperforming constant-diffusivity models by 12–15% in low-concentration regions.","au":["J. Khasanov","S. Muminov","S. Iskandarov"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于非线性反应扩散方程的工业合成氨数学建模","zb":"基于非线性反应扩散方程建立工业合成氨模型，模拟显示对工业数据的浓度剖面预测准确率达98.2%。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1039/d5sc07183f","t":"Strong d–p orbital hybridization in cobalt porphyrin cages promotes electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5sc07183f","s":"Chemical Science","d":"2026-01-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Three metalized porphyrin organic cages, PB-M (M = Co, Ni, Cu), were synthesized. Due to the more positive d-band center and stronger d–p hybridization, the highest faradaic efficiency and ammonia yield were achieved by PB-Co.","au":["You Wu","Yangpeng Zhang","Hao Zhao","Yang Peng","Hailing Ma","Fangyuan Kang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"钴卟啉笼中强 d–p 轨道杂化促进电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"合成了三种金属化卟啉有机笼 PB-M（M = Co, Ni, Cu）。由于 d 带中心更正且 d–p 杂化更强，PB-Co 实现了最高的法拉第效率和氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s44160-025-00984-4","t":"Ammonia synthesis over AuRu alloys","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44160-025-00984-4","s":"Nature Synthesis","d":"2026-01-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"","au":["Alexandra R. Groves"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"AuRu 合金上氨合成","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c19306","t":"Site-Selective Pt Anchoring on Oxygen Vacancies by Atomic Layer Deposition Promotes Metal–Acid Synergy for Enhanced Guaiacol Hydrodeoxygenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c19306","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-01-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"For metal-acid bifunctional catalysts, accurately tuning the spatial distribution of catalytic sites and enhancing the metal-acid synergy remain a challenge. To this end, we combine oxygen vacancy (Ov) engineering with atomic layer deposition (ALD) on Nb2O5·nH2O to simultaneously achieve highly dispersed Pt, enhanced Brønsted acid site (BAS) concentration, and optimized metal-acid synergy. Specifically, for the Pt/Ov-Nb2O5·nH2O catalyst, the abundant Ovs formed in the Ov-Nb2O5·nH2O via H2 heat treatment guide more ALD Pt selective anchoring, thus forming smaller Pt clusters. Additionally, Pt species on the Ovs intensify local NbO6 distortion, inducing more BASs. These acid sites are in close proximity to Pt species, enhancing metal-acid synergistic catalysis. By contrast, Pt/Nb2O5·nH2O, prepared by directly depositing Pt on Nb2O5·nH2O, exhibits a larger Pt cluster size and lower BAS conc","au":["Shudong Liang","Shaocheng Zhang","Qian Jiang","Yufan Zhao","Jing Luo","Xiaohan Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积在氧空位上选择性锚定Pt促进金属-酸协同增强桂酚加氢脱氧","zb":"为金属-酸双功能催化剂，精确调节催化位点的空间分布和增强金属-酸协同作用仍是一大挑战。本研究结合氧空位（Ov）工程与原子层沉积（ALD）在Nb2O5·nH2O上，同时实现了高度分散的Pt、增强的布朗斯特酸位点（BAS）浓度和优化的金属-酸协同作用。Pt/Ov-Nb2O5·nH2O催化剂中，通过H2热处理在Ov-Nb2O5·nH2O中形成的丰富Ovs引导更多ALD Pt选择性锚定，形成更小的Pt团簇。此外，Ov上的Pt物种加剧局部NbO6畸变，诱导更多BASs。这些酸位点与Pt物种紧密邻近，增强金属-酸协同催化。相比之下，Pt/Nb2O5·nH2O通过直接在Nb2O5·nH2O上沉积Pt制备，表现出更大的Pt团簇尺寸和较低的BAS浓度。因此，Pt/Ov-Nb2O5·nH2O在桂酚加氢脱氧（HDO）中表现出高效的桂酚转化率和更高的环己烷选择性。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta08002a","t":"Defect-tailored ZnO nanoflowers enable efficient, metal-free ammonia synthesis through coupled piezoelectric and photocatalytic activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta08002a","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-01-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ZnO–O V nanoflowers combine photo + piezocatalysis for bias-free N 2 reduction. Light + ultrasound drive charges to O V sites, boosting NH 3 with no hydrazine; 15 N verifies. DFT show stronger N 2 adsorption, lower *N 2 → *NNH barrier.","au":["Jyh-Xuan Wang","Hsun-Yen Lin","Kuang Yuan Tu","Jyh-Ming Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"缺陷工程 ZnO 纳米花通过耦合压电和光催化激活实现无金属高效氨合成","zb":"ZnO–O V 纳米花结合光催化与压电催化实现无偏置 N2 还原。光+超声驱动电荷至 O V 位点，15N 验证产氨，DFT 显示 N2 吸附增强且 *N2→*NNH 势垒降低。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202529586","t":"Single‐Nickel‐Atom‐Stabilized Positively Charged Sub‐Nanometric Ruthenium Clusters for Efficient Reduction of Low‐Concentration Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202529586","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-01-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Sub‐nanometric metal clusters, featuring highly exposed active sites and tunable electronic structures, exhibit exceptional activity toward diverse electrocatalytic reactions. However, their high surface energies often induce detachment or aggregation of clusters, leading to deactivation during prolonged electrolysis. Here, we report a robust strategy for stabilizing Ru clusters by leveraging single‐atomic Ni as an electron bridge through Ru−Ni−N 4 interfacial metal coordination. It is demonstrated that the Ni bridges‐induced strong metal‐support interaction effectively suppresses the detachment and aggregation of Ru clusters, enabling long‐term stability of 500 h at a high current density of 1000 mA cm −2 for the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 − RR). Furthermore, the electron transfer from Ru clusters to Ni bridges induces the generation of positively charged ","au":["Tianchi Huang","Taiyu Liang","Jiao You","Qihua Huo","Shuai Qi","Da Wan"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"单镍原子稳定亚纳米正电荷钌簇用于高效低浓度硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"利用 Ru−Ni−N4 界面金属配位，通过单原子镍作为电子桥稳定了亚纳米钌簇。该策略实现了 1000 mA cm−2 高电流密度下 500 h 的长期稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/ijms27010470","t":"Recent Advances in Photoelectrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms27010470","s":"International Journal of Molecular Sciences","d":"2026-01-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia, as an essential chemical, plays an indispensable role in both industry and agriculture. However, the traditional Haber–Bosch technique for ammonia synthesis suffers from high energy consumption and significant CO2 emissions. Therefore, developing an energy-efficient and eco-friendly method for ammonia production is imperative. Photoelectrochemical (PEC) nitrate reduction to ammonia has emerged as a promising green alternative, which utilizes renewable solar energy to convert nitrate into valuable ammonia, thereby contributing to nitrogen recycling and wastewater remediation. This review systematically summarizes recent advances in PEC nitrate reduction to ammonia, focusing on the rational design of efficient photocathodes with the development of semiconductor materials, cocatalysts, p–n junction and heterostructure strategies. Furthermore, the integration of photocathodes with p","au":["Kaixin Zhu","Hefeng Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"光催化硝酸盐还原为氨的最新进展","zb":"综述了光催化硝酸盐还原为氨的最新进展，重点介绍了半导体材料、助催化剂、p–n 结和异质结策略的高效光阴极设计。讨论了机理研究与未来方向。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1088/1674-1056/adfebd","t":"Optimization of the giant magneto-impedance effect in Fe 20 Ni 80 /Cu composite wires by Joule heating annealing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1674-1056/adfebd","s":"Chinese Physics B","d":"2026-01-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Giant magnetoimpedance (GMI) sensors are increasingly employed in modern magnetic sensing technologies. However, improving the GMI performance of magnetic cores remains challenging due to intrinsic limitations in material properties and structural stability. In this work, we explore the use of Joule heating to enhance the GMI response of Fe 20 Ni 80 /Cu composite wires. By applying a current of 1.8 A for 10 min, notable improvements in magnetic domain uniformity and a reduction in domain spacing are observed. Under these conditions, GMI ratios reach 1870% in the non-diagonal mode and 1147% in the diagonal mode, respectively, highlighting their potential for applications in high-precision weak magnetic field sensing.","au":["Xiaofeng 晓凤 Pu 濮","Chaobo 超波 Liu 刘","Zhoulu 周路 Yu 俞","Guozhi 国志 Chai 柴","Junchen 骏琛 Gao 高","Linchuan 琳川 Wang 王"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热退火优化 Fe20Ni80/Cu 复合线的巨磁阻抗效应","zb":"利用焦耳热退火改善了 Fe20Ni80/Cu 复合线的磁畴均匀性。在 1.8 A 电流下处理 10 min，非对角模式和 diagonal 模式下的 GMI 比分别达到 1870% 和 1147%。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1016/j.trechm.2025.10.012","t":"Recent innovations and assessment of ammonia synthesis at an industrial scale","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.trechm.2025.10.012","s":"Trends in Chemistry","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Annu Tyagi","Rohit Chauhan","Ishita Goyal","Kamal Kishore Pant","Vimal Chandra Srivastava","Meenesh R. Singh"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"工业规模氨合成的最新创新与评估","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jocs.2025.102737","t":"Computational Model of Ammonia Synthesis with Catalyst Pellets: Linking the Structure and Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jocs.2025.102737","s":"Journal of Computational Science","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Michael Abeiku Daniels","Anna Geohagan","Agnieszka Truszkowska"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"催化剂颗粒合成 NH3 的计算模型：结构与性能关联","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116567","t":"Facilitating ammonia synthesis via dual-site synergy in a Metal-loporphyrin confined space on metal surface: a DFT study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116567","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Dandan Song","Lili Liu","Kefeng Wu","Leyuan Cui","Ruixuan Qin","Gang Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"金属表面限制空间内金属卟啉双位点协同促进 NH3 合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152673","t":"Perovskite-support enhanced metal hydride chemical looping ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152673","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Ammonia is increasingly valued as a carbon-free energy carrier, offering a promising solution for hydrogen storage and conversion. However, conventional ammonia production faces challenges due to its energy-intensive nature, catalyst scaling limitations, and difficulty integrating with intermittent renewable energy sources. Chemical looping ammonia production (CLAP) presents a compelling alternative, enabling nitrogen fixation under milder conditions and overcoming traditional catalyst scaling issues. In this study, we demonstrate the integration of a tuneable metal oxide support-based perovskite LBFC (La 0.875 Ba 0.125 Fe 0.875 Co 0.125 O 3-δ ) with a catalysed nickel lithium hydride (LiH–Ni) system. The combined system significantly enhances nitrogen fixation, lowering the apparent activation energy of the nitridation reaction from 47.8 kJ mol −1 to 41.1 kJ mol −1 . Notably, the LBFC/N","au":["Jonathan Perry","Ali Salehabadi","Jafar Zanganeh","Behdad Moghtaderi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"钙钛矿增强金属氢化物化学循环合成 NH3","zb":"将可调金属氧化物支撑的钙钛矿 LBFC 与催化镍锂氢化物 (LiH–Ni) 系统集成，显著增强了氮固定。LBFC/Ni–LiH 复合材料将氮化反应的表观活化能从 47.8 kJ mol−1 降低至 41.1 kJ mol−1。在 300 °C 和常压下氨产率为 894 μmol g−1 LiH h−1，5 bar 下增至 2889 μmol g−1 LiH h−1。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152552","t":"NH3 Synthesis with Ca2NH supported Ru catalyst under mild conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152552","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Calcium nitride-hydride supported Ru has demonstrated superior catalytic performance among Ru-based catalysts according to literature. This work explores the impact of Ca 2 NH synthesis precursors on the catalytic performance of Ru–Ca 2 NH in ammonia synthesis, with the goal of gaining deeper insight into their role. For this reason, β-Ca 2 NH was synthesized using CaH 2 and N 2 , which is different from reported in the literature. The structure of the synthesized material was carefully analysed and confirmed via XRD. Subsequently, Ru–Ca 2 NH catalysts were prepared at varying percentages, ranging from 1 % to 10 %, to determine the optimum amount of Ru. The performance of these catalysts was investigated in ammonia synthesis reactions conducted under the continuous gas flow at 340 °C and 0.1 MPa. UV–Vis spectrometry was carried out to determine total ammonia production rate, and was calc","au":["Tugba Akkas Boynuegri","Gavin John Irvine","Samuel Jowitt","Oxana V. Magdysyuk","Huseyin Unsal","Annabel Long"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Ca2NH 支撑 Ru 催化剂在温和条件下合成 NH3","zb":"利用 CaH2 和 N2 合成了 β-Ca2NH，并制备了不同 Ru 含量 (1%-10%) 的 Ru–Ca2NH 催化剂。在 340 °C 和 0.1 MPa 下考察了催化性能，总氨生成速率为 1.6 mmol/g cat. h，高于大多数报道的 Ru 基催化剂。2% 和 5% Ru 负载量表现出最佳活性，加入 BaH2 可显著增加累积氨量。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120756","t":"A carbon-neutral energy platform: integration of solid oxide fuel cell and ammonia synthesis for power and clean fuel","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120756","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Fatemeh Khoshnevis Ansari","Ayat Gharehghani","Samareh Ahmadi","Tohid N. Borhani"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"碳中和能源平台：固体氧化物燃料电池与氨合成的集成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cep.2025.110624","t":"CFD evaluation of a microchannel reactor for ammonia synthesis using a Ruthenium-based catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cep.2025.110624","s":"Chemical Engineering and Processing - Process Intensification","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This work evaluates the potential of microchannel reactors (MCR) for ammonia synthesis using ruthenium-based catalysts through computational fluid dynamics (CFD) modelling. A comprehensive CFD framework was developed that integrates mass and energy balances with modified Temkin-Pyzhev kinetics, and validated against experimental data from a packed-bed reactor (PBR) with less than 5% error. The validated model was then applied to MCR configurations to assess the influence of operating conditions and reactor geometry. Results show that MCRs achieve up to 165 % higher ammonia productivity than PBRs under optimal conditions (100 bar, 430°C), owing to the enhanced heat and mass transfer. Parametric studies identified temperature as the most critical operating parameter, while pressure had a secondary effect. Furthermore, increasing the catalytic layer thickness improved ammonia yields, althou","au":["Leonardo Bravo","Camilo Rengifo Gutierrez","Martha Cobo","Manuel Figueredo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 Ru 催化剂的微通道反应器氨合成 CFD 评估","zb":"通过计算流体动力学 (CFD) 建模评估了微通道反应器 (MCR) 在 Ru 基催化剂合成氨中的潜力。建立了包含质量与能量平衡及修正 Temkin-Pyzhev 动力学的综合 CFD 框架，并在 5% 误差内与实验数据验证。结果表明在 100 bar 和 430°C 条件下，MCR 的氨产率比固定床反应器 (PBR) 高达 165%。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115535","t":"Role of the active metal (Fe, Co and Ni) on the activity of Nd2O3-supported catalysts for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115535","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Nd 2 O 3 -supported Fe, Co, and Ni monometallic catalysts were synthesised and used in the ammonia synthesis reaction. The effect of active metal on the physicochemical and catalytic properties was investigated using, e.g., TPR, TPD, XRD, and STEM. The results showed that the kind of active metal used is the factor determining the catalytic activity in ammonia synthesis. The highest ammonia formation rate was exhibited by Co/Nd 2 O 3 , whereas the highest intrinsic reaction rate (reflected as the TOF value) was shown by Fe/Nd 2 O 3 . Ni/Nd 2 O 3 showed almost no activity in ammonia synthesis. The high ammonia formation rate observed for Co/Nd 2 O 3 was attributable to the well-distributed Co nanoparticles (NPs) on the Nd 2 O 3 support. The Co NPs were less prone to sintering than Fe NPs under reaction conditions. Thus, although showing lower TOF than Fe NPs, the better distribution of Co","au":["Hubert Ronduda","Małgorzata Lemańska","Wojciech Patkowski","Andrzej Ostrowski","Kamil Sobczak","Wioletta Raróg-Pilecka"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Nd2O3 支撑催化剂上活性金属（Fe、Co 和 Ni）对氨合成活性的作用","zb":"合成了 Nd2O3 支撑的 Fe、Co 和 Ni 单金属催化剂用于氨合成反应。通过 TPR、TPD、XRD 和 STEM 等方法研究了活性金属对物理化学性质和催化性能的影响。结果表明 Co/Nd2O3 表现出最高的氨生成速率，而 Fe/Nd2O3 显示出最高的本征反应速率（TOF 值）。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2025.122403","t":"Numerical investigation of a Joule-heated catalytic reactor for enhanced ammonia decomposition to hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2025.122403","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":21,"ab":"","au":["Yanan Sui","Yao Shi","Yitu Hu","Jinghong Zhou","Xuezhi Duan","Xinggui Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition","Joule-heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热催化反应器对氨分解制氢的数值研究","ob":"氨分解制氢｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.rser.2025.116290","t":"Joule heating for carbon material Synthesis: Mechanisms, material evolution, and sustainable prospects","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rser.2025.116290","s":"Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zijun Pan","Xiaolei Shi","Zhengyao Zhu","Xuan Tao","Xujie Zhao","Lujiang Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热用于碳材料合成：机理、材料演变和可持续前景","ob":"涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.oneear.2025.101557","t":"Ultrafast flash Joule heating upcycles biogas residue into high-quality, sustainable graphene composite materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.oneear.2025.101557","s":"One Earth","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mingyue Xu","Bing Deng","Teng Wang","Zhenyu Ren","Ruili Zheng","Jiaqiang Zhong"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"超快闪焦耳热将生物气残渣升级为高质量、可持续的石墨烯复合材料","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.materresbull.2025.113659","t":"Comparison between Thermal and Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition of Zno on Fullerene Powder for Photocatalytic Dye Removal","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.materresbull.2025.113659","s":"Materials Research Bulletin","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ZnO was deposited on fullerene C60 by Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD), carried out in thermal and Plasma Enhanced (PE-ALD) mode. The ALD technique allowed to grow crystalline ZnO stoichiometrically in increasing amount at increasing number of cycles. The conformal deposition was successful even on the walls of the pores of the material: thermal ALD enabled the coverage also of deeper pores, while, as for PE-ALD, ZnO was found mainly on the walls of the most superficial ones. The photocatalytic activity of the ZnO/C60 nanocomposites obtained at 400 cycles by thermal and PE-ALD was evaluated through monitoring the discoloration of a 10-5 M methylene blue solution upon UV irradiation (λ=254 nm) over 180 min. Results indicate that the photocatalytic performance of the thermal coated C60 was higher than the one obtained by PE-ALD (54±12% vs 33±10%, respectively), in accordance with the higher a","au":["Regina Del Sole","Antonella Milella","Francesco Fracassi","Paola Parlanti","Mauro Gemmi","Anna Maria Coclite"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"热处理与等离子体增强原子层沉积在富勒烯粉末上制备 Zno 的比较：用于光催化染料去除","zb":"在富勒烯C60上通过常规热原子层沉积和等离子体增强原子层沉积生长ZnO，评估了400 cycles下ZnO/C60纳米复合物的光催化活性。结果表明，常规热原子层沉积处理的样品光催化性能优于等离子体增强原子层沉积（54±12% vs 33±10%）。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matchemphys.2025.131631","t":"Enhancing CO2 adsorption in Ca-based materials via atomic layer deposition of alumina: Mechanisms and stability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matchemphys.2025.131631","s":"Materials Chemistry and Physics","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Caifeng Huang","Tao Wang","Hemin Hu","Jian Qi"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"在 Ca 基材料中通过原子层沉积氧化铝增强 CO2 吸附：机理和稳定性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jphotochem.2025.116617","t":"Three-dimensional CNTs/TiO2 self-supporting hybrid fabrics constructed via atomic layer deposition for visible-light-enhanced catalytic activity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jphotochem.2025.116617","s":"Journal of Photochemistry and Photobiology A: Chemistry","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jianhua Feng","Tianlin Ma","Jing Yang","Gangling Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积构建的三维CNTs/TiO2自支撑混合织物用于可见光增强催化活性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijrmhm.2025.107439","t":"Rapid preparation of TiC by joule heating synthesis: Efficient photothermal conversion and infrared stealth applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijrmhm.2025.107439","s":"International Journal of Refractory Metals and Hard Materials","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiangyu Ma","Zhaohe Jiang","Shaotian Qi","Lixin Feng","Kun Chen","Dong Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热合成快速制备TiC：高效光热转换和红外隐身应用","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.eng.2025.10.037","t":"Stabilization of Sub-Nanometer Pt Clusters on CoOx Nano-Islands by Area-Selective Atomic Layer Deposition and Machine Learning Insights","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eng.2025.10.037","s":"Engineering","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Sub-nanometer metallic clusters have attracted considerable interest owing to their high surface area and size-dependent properties. However, their high surface energies cause thermal instability, leading to aggregation and sintering that limit practical applications. In this study, we obtained sub-nanometer Pt clusters (average size ∼0.76 nm) with highly stable configuration, deposited on CoO x nano-islands by area-selective deposition (ASD). The Pt-CoO x structures exhibited low Pt loading and high deposition selectivity. During ASD, Pt clusters were selectively deposited on CoO x regions, where strong metal-support interactions (MSI) between Pt and CoO x supported effective anchoring. Subsequent H 2 post-treatment promoted electron transfer between Pt and CoO x as well as Pt cluster migration from the Al 2 O 3 substrate to the CoO x nano-islands, particularly at the Al 2 O 3 -CoO x in","au":["Rongli Ye","Fangwen Ye","Junyang Chen","Xianbao Duan","Yaohui Dun","Bin Shan"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"面积选择性原子层沉积和机器学习对亚纳米Pt团簇在CoOx纳米岛上的稳定作用","zb":"通过区域选择性沉积在CoOx纳米岛上制备了平均尺寸约0.76 nm的亚纳米Pt团簇，利用机器学习模拟揭示Pt迁移方向。经600 °C高温老化后，Pt团簇仍高度分散无烧结，得益于CoOx纳米岛的物理隔离和强金属-载体相互作用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.elecom.2025.108091","t":"Influence of atomic layer deposition on nickel hydroxide phase transitions in nickel foam","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.elecom.2025.108091","s":"Electrochemistry Communications","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study investigates how Al 2 O 3 and V 2 O 5 coatings deposited on nickel foam by atomic layer deposition (ALD) modifies its electrochemical phase evolution in alkaline media. Phase transitions and surface kinetics were characterized using cyclic voltammetry (CV), in situ X-ray diffraction (XRD), electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS), and Tafel analysis. Bare NF exhibits a positive cathodic peak shift for α-Ni(OH) 2 formation over 100 CV cycles attributed to surface activation. NF coated with Al 2 O 3 (NF-A) showed a larger shift (+90 mV) indicating enhanced charge transfer kinetics and reduced energy barrier. In contrast, V 2 O 5 -coated NF (NF-V) showed no shift suggesting a suppressed surface kinetics. These shifts disappear at higher scan rates suggesting a kinetic effect rather than a diffusion-induced behavior. Tafel and EIS measurements show that NF-A has the lowest cha","au":["Samutr Assavachin","Surat Prempluem","Somlak Ittisanronnachai","Sukritta Janprakhon","Montree Sawangphruk"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积对镍泡沫镍氢氧化物相变的影响","zb":"研究通过原子层沉积在泡沫镍上制备Al2O3和V2O5涂层，利用循环伏安、原位XRD等表征碱性介质下的相变与表面动力学。结果表明，Al2O3涂层显著增强电荷转移动力学，而V2O5涂层抑制表面动力学，原位XRD证实了α-Ni(OH)2的形成。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cep.2025.110643","t":"Ultrasound and electromagnetic heating assisted biodiesel production from waste cooking oil using paphia undulata shell-based CaO catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cep.2025.110643","s":"Chemical Engineering and Processing - Process Intensification","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ilmi","Suherman","Renita Manurung","Yasmin Anggia Sari","Frans Tambunan","Juni Hardi Panjaitan"],"o":"回填","why":["magnetic heat"],"zt":"超声和电磁加热辅助的废弃食用油生物柴油制备——基于掌叶桉壳CaO催化剂","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.171697","t":"Fast preparation of BiIn alloy membrane by joule heating for highly-efficient CO2 electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.171697","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Hui Ning","Rui Zhou","Minjun Zhou","Hongbin Wang","Yapeng Lv","Jiwei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热快速制备BiIn合金膜用于高效CO2电还原","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.164667","t":"Atomic Layer Deposition of Alumina and Zinc Oxide Nanofilms on Ceria Nanoparticles Using a Custom Fluidized Bed Reactor for Tunable Ultraviolet Blocking Property","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.164667","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Guanghui Yan","Heng Yu","Lu Jin","Yi Ouyang","Guoxiang Chen","Gaoshan Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"使用定制流化床反应器在二氧化铈纳米颗粒上原子层沉积氧化铝和氧化锌纳米薄膜以调节紫外线阻挡性能","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153151","t":"Enabling ammonia-to-hydrogen conversion via multiple pathways: Thermocatalytic, electrochemical, and photocatalytic decomposition technologies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153151","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shuo Wei","Bin Guan","Lei Zhu","Shiying Chang","Jiangli Ma","Rong Wang"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过多种途径实现氨制氢：热催化、电化学和光催化分解技术","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2025.94908274","t":"Light-powered ambient-pressure ammonia synthesis using a plasmonic semiconducting catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2025.94908274","s":"Nano Research","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia plays a critical role in our society, not only as the source for fertilizers and other essential chemicals, but also as a promising hydrogen carrier due to its high energy density and ease of storage and transportation. However, the conventional Haber–Bosch process is energy-intensive and costly. Developing a more energy efficient route for ammonia production is currently a holy grail in scientific society. This study reports a plasmonic semiconductor catalyst—molybdenum oxynitride (Mo2N/MoO2-x) nanosheets—that enables ambient-pressure NH3 synthesis under light illumination. The catalyst achieves a remarkable NH3 production rate of 2338 µmol·g-1·h-1 at 400°C and 857 µmol·g-1·h-1 at room temperature. Notably, we present evidence for the coexistence of both nonthermal and photothermal effects, distinguishing this system from photothermally driven routes. This work demonstrates a vi","au":["Yifan Yu","Vasishta Somayaji","Zhijia Geng","Abraham J. Offen","Jiawei Liang","Jie Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"使用等离激元半导体催化剂的光驱动常压氨合成","zb":"报道了一种等离激元半导体催化剂——Mo2N/MoO2-x纳米片，可在光照下实现常压氨合成。该催化剂在400°C下达到2338 µmol·g-1·h-1的氨产率，在室温下达到857 µmol·g-1·h-1。研究证实了非热效应和光热效应的共存，展示了利用水、空气和阳光进行分布式氨合成的潜力。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.watres.2025.124936","t":"Coupling iron oxide with iron single-atom catalyst promotes neutral electrochemical nitrate reduction from water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2025.124936","s":"Water Research","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) presents a promising approach for sustainable water denitrification. Yet its practical implementation is hindered by sluggish reaction kinetics. Herein, we develop a dual-functional catalyst comprising carbon-wrapped Fe3O4 nanoparticles integrated with Fe single atom sites (FeNC-Fe3O4), which demonstrates exceptional activity and stability for NO3RR. The FeNC-Fe3O4 achieves a Faradic efficiency of 95.63 % and an NH3 yield of 2.95 mg cm-2 h-1 at -0.6 V vs. RHE in a neutral electrolyte. Mechanistic investigations, including in situ analysis and density functional theory calculations, reveal that the synergetic interplay between FeNC and Fe3O4 nanoparticles and the enlargement on double-layer capacitance, reduces the energy barrier for key intermediates, and provides abundant active sites for NO3RR. Furthermore, the catalyst exhibits an 85.","au":["Jinshan Wei","Xihui Lu","Hexing Lin","Shao-Qing Liu","Xiaoxiao Wei","Meng Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"耦合氧化铁与铁单原子催化剂促进中性条件下水的电化学硝酸盐还原","zb":"开发了一种由碳包覆Fe3O4纳米颗粒与Fe单原子位点（FeNC-Fe3O4）组成的双功能催化剂，用于中性电解液中的电化学硝酸盐还原反应。该催化剂在-0.6 V vs RHE下实现了95.63%的法拉第效率和2.95 mg cm-2 h-1的氨产率，并表现出85.1%的硝酸盐转化效率和87.2%的N2选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.pecs.2025.101262","t":"Thermocatalytic ammonia synthesis beyond conventional Haber-Bosch: Principles, advances, challenges and opportunities","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pecs.2025.101262","s":"Progress in Energy and Combustion Science","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Transforming ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis from the energy-intensive, fossil-fuel-dependent conventional Haber-Bosch (HB) process to a flexible, green hydrogen-based process is pivotal for decarbonization and enabling NH 3 utilization in the energy sector. The conventional HB process, operating under high temperature and pressure, is incompatible with green hydrogen systems and economically unviable for downscaled NH 3 production integrated with intermittent renewable energies . Therefore, developing alternatives capable of synthesizing NH 3 under moderate conditions is crucial for achieving green NH 3 production. This necessity has driven the development of a range of emerging technologies, including thermocatalytic, electrocatalytic, photocatalytic, and plasma-assisted processes, amongst which thermocatalysis stands out in terms of production rate, technology readiness, and economic feasib","au":["Tianbao Gu","Matej Huš","Samuel Simon Araya","Blaž Likozar","Fausto Gallucci","Vincenzo Liso"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"超越传统哈伯-博施法的热催化氨合成：原理、进展、挑战与机遇","zb":"综述了超越传统哈伯-博施的催化氨合成技术，重点分析了热催化工艺在温和条件下合成氨的潜力。文章探讨了催化剂开发、反应器强化、工艺集成及系统评估等关键进展，并讨论了实现高氨产率面临的科学障碍、经济分析和环境影响。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mtener.2025.102164","t":"Bidirectional nitrogen neutralization via electrocatalysis on CuO-CoO/NF: Hydrazine oxidation-assisted nitrate reduction toward artificial nitrogen cycling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mtener.2025.102164","s":"Materials Today Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wei Han","Zixuan Xie","Sen Qiao","Qiuhua Xu","Suqin Ci","Zhenhai Wen"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"CuO-CoO/NF上电催化双向氮中和：肼氧化辅助硝酸盐还原以实现人工氮循环","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mseb.2025.118675","t":"Atomically dispersed active sites for the electrocatalytic synthesis of ammonia and other nitrogen-containing compounds","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mseb.2025.118675","s":"Materials Science and Engineering: B","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yong Li","Tianyu Gao","Dechao Chen","Lili Han"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"用于电催化合成氨及其他含氮化合物的原子分散活性位点","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matdes.2025.115370","t":"Electronic structure and catalytic activity of TM@Mg12O12 nanocages for ambient ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matdes.2025.115370","s":"Materials & Design","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"• Novel transition metal atoms doped Mg 12 O 12 nanocages as single atom catalysts have been designed. • These catalysts are thermodynamically stable with interaction energies of −2.49 to −0.48 eV. • Transition-metal atom decoration of Mg 12 O 12 nanocages greatly enhances N 2 activation efficiency. • Mn@Mg 12 O 12 shows a low limiting potential (−0.84 V) for ambient ammonia synthesis. • These findings provide new routes for designing efficient catalysts for sustainable nitrogen reduction. The development of low-cost and efficient electrocatalysts for the ambient nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is essential for the synthesis of NH 3 and offers a substitute for the conventional Haber-Bosch process. In the present work, density functional theory (DFT) is employed to investigate the electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) catalysed by TM@Mg 12 O 12 (TM=Sc ∼ Zn) nanocages. All co","au":["Rehana Bano","Béla Viskolcz","Béla Fiser"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"TM@Mg12O12 纳米笼用于环境温度 NH3 合成的电子结构与催化活性","zb":"本研究利用密度泛函理论研究了 TM@Mg12O12 (TM=Sc ∼ Zn) 纳米笼对电化学氮还原反应的催化活性。结果表明 TM 掺杂显著降低了 Mg12O12 的能隙，增强了导电性，并显著提升了 N2 活化效率。其中 Mn@Mg12O12 表现出最高的活性，其极限电位为 -0.84 V。该研究为设计可持续氮还原的高效催化剂提供了新思路。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238907","t":"A review of recent progress and future perspectives in catalyst design for the electrocatalytic ammonia oxidation reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238907","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ta Nam Nguyen","Tuan Linh Doan","Taekeun Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic ammonia"],"ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jes.2025.03.032","t":"Enhanced nitrate reduction to ammonia using Cu-Ni catalyst: Synergistic mechanisms and reaction pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jes.2025.03.032","s":"Journal of Environmental Sciences","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Accelerated industrialization combined with over-applied nitrogen fertilizers results in serious nitrate pollution in surface and ground water, disrupting the balance of the global nitrogen cycle. Electrochemical nitrate reduction (eNO3RR) emerges as an attractive strategy to simultaneously enable nitrate removal and decentralized ammonia fabrication, restoring the globally perturbed nitrogen cycle. However, complex deoxygenation-hydrogenation processes and sluggish proton-electron transfer kinetics significantly hinder practical application of eNO3RR. In this study, we developed carbon-coated Cu-Ni bimetallic catalysts derived from metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) to facilitate eNO3RR. The unique structural features of catalyst promote enhanced synergy between Cu and Ni, effectively addressing critical challenges in nitrate reduction. Comprehensive structural and electrochemical analysis","au":["Yansen Qu","Xin Li","Yingjie Xia","Haosheng Lan","Le Ding","Jing Zhong"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zb":"本研究利用金属有机框架制备碳包覆 Cu-Ni 双金属催化剂用于电化学硝酸盐还原。研究发现电化学硝酸盐到亚硝酸盐的转化主要发生在 Cu 活性位点，Ni 的引入加速了活性氢的生成并促进氢化物中间体的转化。Ni 还能提升催化剂的 d 带中心，增强硝酸盐及中间体的吸附活化。得益于 Cu 和 Ni 的协同效应，该催化剂表现出优异的硝酸盐还原性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.08.037","t":"Weakened ionization electrolyte with n-hexane additive enabling high activity of lithium-mediated nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.08.037","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yunfei Huan","Yanzheng He","Zhenkang Wang","Haoqing Ji","Sisi Liu","Lifang Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2025.138903","t":"Preparation of Ti3C2TxMXene-based copper/cobalt composites for electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.138903","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"MXenes represent exceptionally promising electrocatalytic materials for ammonia synthesis, owing to their outstanding electrical conductivity, modifiable surface functional groups, exceptional hydrophilicity, high specific surface area, and electronegative surface characteristics. In this investigation, we systematically demonstrate that the persistent challenge of Cu and Co nanoparticle agglomeration can be effectively addressed through the in-situ growth of bimetallic CuCo nanoparticles on Ti3C2TxMXene nanosheets. This innovative approach significantly enlarges the electrochemically active surface area, maximizes the exposure of catalytically active sites, and optimizes mass transport properties, consequently leading to substantially enhanced electrocatalytic performance for ammonia synthesis. Among the series of CuxCoy/MXene composites developed, the Cu2Co1/MXene hybrid catalyst demon","au":["Guan Sheng","Yudong Jiang","Zirong Yan","Jinshu Tian","Shaobo Tu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于电催化氨合成的Ti3C2TxMXene基铜/钴复合材料的制备","zb":"本研究通过在Ti3C2TxMXene纳米片上原位生长双金属CuCo纳米颗粒，有效解决了Cu和Co纳米颗粒团聚的难题。制备的CuxCoy/MXene复合材料中，Cu2Co1/MXene杂化催化剂表现出优异的硝酸盐还原反应NO3RR活性，在-0.85 V vs RHE下实现了2.73 mg cm-2 h-1的氨产率、72.05%的法拉第效率和90.6%的选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116566","t":"Unraveling the nitrogen fixation and electrochemical reduction to ammonia on IrO2 (1 1 0): DFT, ESM-RISM, and microkinetic simulation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116566","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shih-Huang Pan","Minoru Otani","Tsuyoshi Miyazaki","Jyh-Chiang Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"揭示IrO2 (1 1 0)上的氮固定与电化学还原为氨：DFT、ESM-RISM和微观动力学模拟","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153133","t":"Atomic-level engineering of Cu-based nanostructured catalysts: Pioneering pathways for sustainable nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153133","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wentao Wang","Yilin Wu","Pengzuo Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"基于铜的纳米结构催化剂的原子级工程：可持续硝酸盐制氨电合成的前沿路径","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153128","t":"Performance analysis and optimization of multi-zone catalyst reactors for cost-effective ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.153128","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Peipei Ma","Zixuan Wang","Chengjie Li","Jiang Qin","Zheng Zhong","Zehua Pan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"用于成本效益氨分解的多区催化剂反应器性能分析与优化","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152961","t":"Low Ruthenium Loading Ru/Coxalo Hydrotalcite-Derived Catalyst Design for Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152961","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lei Guo","Zhongrui Li","Tong Zhang","Juan Qiu","Zongyao Duan","Yunhua Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"用于氨分解的低负载量钌Ru/Coxalo水滑石衍生催化剂设计","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152688","t":"Numerical investigation of sorption-enhanced ammonia synthesis for hydrogen storage: CFD modeling, experimental validation, and scale-up","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152688","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ) is increasingly recognized as a clean hydrogen (H 2 ) carrier due to its high H 2 content, carbon neutrality, and ease of storage and transport. Realizing its potential as an energy vector requires synthesis technologies that operate under mild conditions and are compatible with water electrolysis. This study develops a comprehensive computational fluid dynamics (CFD) model of sorption-enhanced NH 3 synthesis with alternating catalyst and sorbent layers, validated against experimental data, to elucidate the in-situ sorption effects. The model is subsequently employed to scale up the process and to optimize the operation conditions of a pilot-scale reactor. Results indicate a 66.8% increase in H 2 conversion with a six-layer configuration, while a 60-layer pilot reactor achieves over 90% conversion and 99.5% NH 3 capture in single-pass operation. These findings demonstrate","au":["Tianbao Gu","Elizaveta Taranets","Hossein Asgharian","Samuel Simon Araya","Fausto Gallucci","Vincenzo Liso"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"吸附增强合成 NH3 用于氢存储的数值研究","zb":"本研究开发了一种吸附增强氨合成反应器的计算流体动力学CFD模型，该模型包含交替排列的催化剂和吸附剂层，并通过实验数据验证。结果表明，六层配置使H2转化率提高了66.8%，而60层中试反应器在单程操作中实现了超过90%的转化率和99.5%的NH3捕获率。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.136336","t":"Boronated aromatic ring-fused structure: An efficient electrocatalyst for sustainable ammonia synthesis from nitric oxide pollutant","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.136336","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Naga Venkateswara Rao Nulakani","Venkata Surya Kumar Choutipalli","Kevin L. Shuford","Mohamad Akbar Ali"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"硼化芳香环稠合结构：从一氧化氮污染物可持续合成氨的高效电催化剂","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120796","t":"Comparative assessment of ammonia decomposition processes based on nickel and ruthenium catalysts: A techno-economic perspective","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120796","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Seoyeon Cho","Yejin Lee","Inkyu Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"基于镍和钌催化剂的氨分解过程技术经济性评估：比较研究","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120700","t":"Conceptual design and 4E analysis of an ammonia synthesis process integrating methane thermal decomposition and dual chemical looping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120700","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"• Ammonia synthesis integrates methane pyrolysis and dual chemical looping. • 4E analysis evaluates energy, exergy, environmental, and economic performance. • Energy and exergy efficiency increases of 8.4 % and 19 %, respectively. • Global warming potential reduced by 15.85 kg CO 2 -eq per kg ammonia. • Levelized cost of ammonia decreased to 336.97 USD/t NH 3 in integrated case. Ammonia has emerged as a promising hydrogen carrier and potential carbon-free fuel, increasing the demand for sustainable and energy-efficient production technologies. Conventional ammonia synthesis accounts for ∼1 %–2% of global energy use and 1 %–1.3 % of total greenhouse gas emissions, necessitating alternative approaches with lower environmental impacts. This study proposes an ammonia-production pathway that integrates methane thermal decomposition with a dual-chemical-looping system based on iron oxide (Fe 2","au":["Inhye Kim","Minsuk Lim","Jeongjae Oh","Dongwoo Kang","Sunghyun Cho"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"集成甲烷热解与双化学链的氨合成工艺的概念设计与 4E 分析","zb":"提出集成甲烷热解与基于 Fe2O3 和 Al2O3 的双化学链系统的氨生产路径，利用 4E 分析评估其能效、㶲效、环境及经济性能。结果表明该工艺相比传统路线能效提升 8.4%，㶲效提升 19%，每千克氨的全球变暖潜势降低 15.85 kg CO2-eq，平准化成本降至 336.97 USD/t NH3。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120672","t":"Sustainable green ammonia production: A comparative study of PEM electrolyzer–Haber–Bosch vs. chemical looping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120672","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Danial Hosseinzadeh","Ayat Gharehghani","Jabraeil Ahbabi Saray"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"可持续绿色氨生产：质子交换膜电解槽-哈伯-博施与化学链的对比研究","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120578","t":"Second law analysis of overpotentials in a lithium-mediated electrochemical ammonia production cell","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120578","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This article presents a thermodynamic framework based on the second law of thermodynamics for predicting overpotential irreversibilities in a lithium-mediated electrochemical cell for ammonia synthesis. It analyzes experimental data from prior studies, in terms of the overpotential entropy generation, and identifies regions where entropy generation is minimized. Overpotential models for the activation kinetics, nucleation, mass transport, and ohmic resistance of the electrochemical cell are developed as functions of the operating current density. Analysis of potentiodynamic and impedance data was used to determine the key electrochemical parameters of the system. A differential analysis identified the charge transfer coefficients, and improvements were found when comparing its correlation coefficient to that obtained through logarithmic analysis in a previous study. The predictive model ","au":["Sebastian Reyna-Martinez","Kevin Pope","Greg F. Naterer"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"锂介导电化学氨合成电池中过电势的第二定律分析","zb":"基于热力学第二定律建立预测锂介导电化学电池过电势不可逆性的框架，分析过电势熵产生并识别最小化区域。开发了包含活化动力学、成核、传质和欧姆电阻的过电势模型，通过电位扫描和阻抗数据分析确定关键参数。该模型应用于高法拉第效率的电池，评估了系统熵产生，并与实验数据对比。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2025.147701","t":"Selective nitrate reduction on PtPd(100) alloy single crystals: tuning ammonia and nitrogen formation in alkaline medium","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2025.147701","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate presents a promising approach for mitigating nitrogen pollution while producing valuable nitrogen-based compounds. This study investigates the catalytic performance of PtPd bulk alloy electrodes with a (100) orientation, varying alloyed-Pd concentrations on a Pt(100) substrate. Our findings demonstrate that Pd incorporation significantly enhances catalytic activity in alkaline medium, with an optimal Pt-Pd atomic ratio maximizing performance. Systematic electrochemical analysis confirms the formation of ammonia as the primary product with nitrogen gas as a secondary product. The activity enhancement is attributed to forming a less compact NO-adlayer and a lower energetic barrier for overcoming the rate-determining step at adjacent Pt-Pd sites. Further analysis reveals that it is more easily surpassed at lower scan rates and elevated temperatures. ","au":["Pepe Jordá-Faus","Francisco J. Vidal-Iglesias","Juan M. Feliu","Enrique Herrero","Rosa M. Arán-Ais"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"碱性介质中 PtPd(100) 合金单晶上选择性的硝酸根还原：调节氨气和氮气生成","zb":"研究在碱性介质中 PtPd(100) 合金单晶电极上硝酸根的电化学还原性能，通过改变 Pd 含量优化原子比。结果表明 Pd 掺杂显著提升了催化活性，氨气是主要产物，氮气是次要产物。活性增强归因于形成更疏松的 NO 吸附层以及降低了相邻 Pt-Pd 位点克服决速步能垒的难度。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cjche.2025.10.001","t":"Immobilization strategies, supporting materials, and performance advantages of photocatalysts in ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cjche.2025.10.001","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qian Su","Pengfei Wang","Cheng Zuo","Jinghe Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"光催化剂在氨合成中的固定化策略、载体材料及性能优势","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cejgas.2025.100001","t":"Frontiers in catalytic ammonia decomposition: A cutting-edge tutorial and review on catalyst innovation trends and techno-economic insights","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cejgas.2025.100001","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal: Green and Sustainable","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is emerging as a promising hydrogen carrier due to its high hydrogen content (17.6 wt%) and favorable storage and transport properties. This review highlights the growing potential of ammonia decomposition for sustainable hydrogen production, particularly in portable and industrial applications. The focus is on catalyst development, especially non-noble metals such as iron, cobalt, and nickel, which are gaining traction due to enhanced support structures, metal dispersion, and promoters. Recent efforts also emphasize the role of novel catalytic materials with high thermal stability and resistance to deactivation under reaction conditions. Reactor innovations including microreactors, monolithic reactors, and membrane systems enable integrated decomposition and hydrogen purification. Techno-economic assessments further confirm the feasibility of ammonia cracking, especially when in","au":["Umer Aizaz","Mohd Asad Ansari","Zuhair Omar Malaibari","Ijaz Hussain"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"催化氨分解的前沿：催化剂创新趋势和技术经济见解的尖端教程与综述","zb":"该综述探讨了氨分解作为可持续制氢途径的潜力，重点关注铁、钴和镍等非贵金属催化剂的开发。文章讨论了新型催化材料的高热稳定性、助剂及反应器创新（如微反应器、膜系统）。技术经济评估表明，结合可再生能源的氨裂解具有竞争力，是迈向低碳能源未来的可扩展且低成本途径。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.172257","t":"Decoupling Photocatalytic Nitrogen Activation: Broad-Spectrum Ammonia Synthesis in Pure Water via Attenuated Hole Oxidation Dynamics in Intrinsically Active Bi2O2Se","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.172257","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jiayu Gu","Chen Wei","Jinhao Xu","Xiu Zhang","Chunjie Zhu","Da Teng"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"解耦光催化氮活化：通过内在活性Bi2O2Se中衰减的空穴氧化动力学实现纯水中宽光谱氨合成","ob":"光驱动","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115528","t":"Highly dispersed ruthenium atomic-cluster adjacent to CeO2 oxygen vacancy as an active catalyst for ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115528","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tae Oh Son","Jae Min Park","Do Heui Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"高度分散的Ru原子簇与CeO2氧空位邻近作为氨分解活性催化剂","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcata.2025.120664","t":"Investigation of the ammonia cracking kinetics over Ru/Al2O3 using conductive reactor internals","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcata.2025.120664","s":"Applied Catalysis A: General","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"NH3 cracking is receiving growing attention for the exploitation of ammonia as H2 carrier. Of the different aspects of this process that require in depth study, the choice of the optimal catalyst is arguably one of the most important, being the process kinetically controlled. Literature agrees that ruthenium is the most active metal for low temperature ammonia cracking, however, no consensus on the kinetic expression has been reached due to the high sensitivity of the reaction mechanism to the specific reaction conditions. For this reason, it is of utmost importance to work in conditions as close as possible to the industrial ones to derive a reaction rate useful for practical reactor design. This is challenging due to the strong endothermicity of the reaction that leads to non-uniform temperature profiles in concentrated kinetic tests, the detrimental impact of temperature gradients in ","au":["Federico Sascha Franchi","Matteo Ambrosetti","Nicola Usberti","Alessandra Beretta","Gianpiero Groppi","Enrico Tronconi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"使用导电反应器内件研究 Ru/Al2O3 上氨裂解的动力学","zb":"在 2500 至 20,000 Ncm3/h/gcat 范围内研究了商业 Ru/Al2O3 催化剂的氨裂解活性。引入导热铝 POCS 反应器内件实现了近等温条件，拟合得到 MPE 小于 5% 的 LHHW 速率表达式。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mseb.2025.118798","t":"Template-activation coupled synthesis of petroleum pitch-based activated carbon for enhanced ammonia adsorption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mseb.2025.118798","s":"Materials Science and Engineering: B","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Gaoqi Han","Yang Hao","Hao Wang","Rui Han","Qingling Liu"],"o":"回填","zt":"用于增强氨吸附的石油沥青基活性碳的模板-活化耦合合成","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpcs.2025.113037","t":"Construction of heterostructured CuO–Co3O4 catalyst for hydrogen evolution from ammonia borane hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpcs.2025.113037","s":"Journal of Physics and Chemistry of Solids","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Wenke Zhang","Junhui Liu","Jia Wang","Yaowei Dong","Junna Liu","Xiang Li"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.08.051","t":"Joule heating activation-assisted full-depth doping enabling fast-kinetic and stable micro silicon anodes in solid-state batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.08.051","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Xin Qin","Zuqiang Ge","Yafei Wang","Guanzhong Ma","Fei Yang","Qian Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"]},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.171567","t":"Flash joule heating driven oxygen vacancy engineering in siloxene toward ultra-stable lithium-ion batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.171567","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Quanqiang Yuan","Chengcheng He","Rui Sun","Jianlin Liang","Yaoxiang Shang","Longqing Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热驱动的硅烯氧空位工程用于超稳定锂离子电池","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.biortech.2025.133293","t":"Synergistic ammonia recovery from high-ammonia anaerobic digestate via coupled bipolar electrodialysis and membrane contactor system","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2025.133293","s":"Bioresource Technology","d":"2026-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study evaluates ammonia gas recovery from high-strength anaerobic digestate using a bipolar membrane electrodialysis (BPED) and membrane contactor (MC). Ammonia is a promising carbon-neutral energy carrier, while digestates present both environmental challenges and opportunities for ammonia recovery. The BPED was tested at 2,000---10,000 mg-N/L under varying voltages and flow rates, achieving up to 87.6 % ammonium separation at 10,000 mg-N/L. Subsequently, the MC enabled direct gas-phase NH3 recovery, using synthetic base solutions under different vacuum pressures and sweep gas flow rates. Recovery reached 80.9 % at low gas-to-liquid ratios (180-720), outperforming air stripping. Ammonia recovery followed first-order kinetics, with overall mass transfer (K·a) governed by vacuum pressure, sweep gas, and pH-dependent speciation. NH3-N flux showed nonlinear dependence on the ionization","au":["Bora Shin","Choah Kim","Jinsoo Cho","Kyung Guen Song"],"o":"回填","zt":"耦合双极膜电渗析和膜接触器系统从高氨厌氧消化液中协同回收氨","zb":"该研究利用双极膜电渗析（BPED）和膜接触器（MC）从高浓度厌氧消化液中回收氨气。在10,000 mg-N/L条件下，BPED实现了高达87.6%的铵分离率；随后MC在低气液比（180-720）下通过真空压力和吹扫气流实现了80.9%的气相NH3回收，优于空气吹脱。该系统遵循一级动力学，整体传质系数受真空压力和pH物种分布控制。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"}]);
